INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('sdebaun/turnout-mvp/roadmap', 'roadmap', 'sdebaun', 'turnout-mvp', 'community', 'roadmap sdebaun turnout-mvp community The roadmap skill generates a structured roadmap in 15 minutes, linking every initiative to business objectives and measurable outcomes, ideal for quarterly or annual planning cycles and executive alignment meetings. roadmap AI工具帮助开发者快速生成结构化路线图，连接业务目标和可衡量结果 ロードマップビルダーは、ビジネス目標に結びついた構造化されたロードマップを15分で生成 로드맵 빌더는 비즈니스 목표에 연결된 구조화된 로드맵을 15분만에 생성 Nuestro generador de hoja de ruta crea una estructura en 15 minutos, conectando iniciativas a objetivos empresariales y resultados medibles. Notre outil de feuille de route crée une structure en 15 minutes, reliant les initiatives aux objectifs commerciaux et aux résultats mesurables. Unser Roadmap-Tool erstellt eine Struktur in 15 Minuten, die Initiativen mit Geschäftszielen und messbaren Ergebnissen verbindet. O Roadmap Builder gera uma roadmap estruturada que liga cada iniciativa a objetivos de negócios e resultados mensuráveis, ideal para ciclos de planejamento trimestral ou anual Roadmap Builder генерирует структурированную дорожную карту, связывая каждую инициативу с бизнес-целями и измеримыми результатами, подходящую для квартальных или годовых циклов планирования أداة بناء الخارطة تُ.generated خارطة طريق متكاملة تربط كل مبادرة بأهداف الأعمال ونَتائج قابلة للقياس، مثالية لدوائر التخطيط الربع سنوية أو السنوية how to use roadmap what is roadmap roadmap alternative roadmap vs competitor roadmap install roadmap setup guide structured roadmap builder roadmap for AI agents roadmap for quarterly planning roadmap for annual planning roadmap AI工具 结构化路线图 业务目标 可衡量结果 季度规划 年度规划 高管对齐 董事会对齐 新项目经理入职 Generates a structured roadmap in 15 minutes Links every initiative to business objectives and measurable outcomes Supports quarterly or annual planning cycles Facilitates executive or board alignment meetings Enables new PM onboarding to existing roadmap Allows for strategic reprioritization after major changes Roadmap is a structured plan that connects initiatives to business objectives and measurable outcomes, used for quarterly or annual planning cycles and strategic reprioritization.');
