s","Unreal Engine 5.x","C++ para juegos"],"fr":["Unreal Engine C++","développement de jeux","C++ pour Unreal Engine","optimisation de performance","débogage des fuites de mémoire","implémentation de fonctionnalités exposées à Blueprint","Outils de développement de jeux","Unreal Engine 5.x","C++ pour jeux"],"de":["Unreal Engine C++","Spielentwicklung","C++ für Unreal Engine","Leistungs-Optimierung","Fehlerbehebung von Speicherverlusten","Implementierung von Blueprint-exponierten Funktionen","Entwicklungstools für Spiele","Unreal Engine 5.x","C++ für Spiele","AI-Tools für Spielentwicklung"],"pt":["Unreal Engine C++ Pro","Desenvolvimento de giochi","C++ para Unreal Engine","Otimização de desempenho","Depuração de vazamentos de memória","Implementação de funcionalidades via Blueprint","Programação de jogos","Desenvolvimento de projetos Unreal Engine 5"],"ru":["Unreal Engine C++ Pro - ИИ Агенты","Разработка игр","C++ для Unreal Engine","Оптимизация производительности","Отладка утечек памяти","Реализация функциональности через Blueprint","Программирование игр","Разработка проектов Unreal Engine 5 - ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Unreal Engine C++ Pro لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الألعاب","C++ ل Unreal Engine","تحسين الأداء","تصحيح أخطاء تسرب الذاكرة","تنفيذ الوظائف عبر Blueprint","برمجة الألعاب","تطوير مشاريع Unreal Engine 5 لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"superbear1945","repo":"BearSurvior_UE5","repoPath":"superbear1945/BearSurvior_UE5","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T16:39:14Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"unreal-engine-cpp-pro","description":"Expert guide for Unreal Engine 5.x C++ development, covering UObject hygiene, performance patterns, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# Unreal Engine C++ Pro\n\nThis skill provides expert-level guidelines for developing with Unreal Engine 5 using C++. It focuses on writing robust, performant, and standard-compliant code.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Developing C++ code for Unreal Engine 5.x projects\n- Writing Actors, Components, or UObject-derived classes\n- Optimizing performance-critical code in Unreal Engine\n- Debugging memory leaks or garbage collection issues\n- Implementing Blueprint-exposed functionality\n- Follow","body":"# Unreal Engine C++ Pro\n\nThis skill provides expert-level guidelines for developing with Unreal Engine 5 using C++. It focuses on writing robust, performant, and standard-compliant code.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Developing C++ code for Unreal Engine 5.x projects\n- Writing Actors, Components, or UObject-derived classes\n- Optimizing performance-critical code in Unreal Engine\n- Debugging memory leaks or garbage collection issues\n- Implementing Blueprint-exposed functionality\n- Following Epic Games'' coding standards and conventions\n- Working with Unreal''s reflection system (UCLASS, USTRUCT, UFUNCTION)\n- Managing asset loading and soft references\n\nDo not use this skill when:\n- Working with Blueprint-only projects (no C++ code)\n- Developing for Unreal Engine versions prior to 5.x\n- Working on non-Unreal game engines\n- The task is unrelated to Unreal Engine development\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1.  **UObject & Garbage Collection**:\n    *   Always use `UPROPERTY()` for `UObject*` member variables to ensure they are tracked by the Garbage Collector (GC).\n    *   Use `TStrongObjectPtr<>` if you need to keep a root reference outside of a UObject graph, but prefer `addToRoot()` generally.\n    *   Understand the `IsValid()` check vs `nullptr`. `IsValid()` handles pending kill state safely.\n\n2.  **Unreal Reflection System**:\n    *   Use `UCLASS()`, `USTRUCT()`, `UENUM()`, `UFUNCTION()` to expose types to the reflection system and Blueprints.\n    *   Minimize `BlueprintReadWrite` when possible; prefer `BlueprintReadOnly` for state that shouldn''t be trampled by logic in UI/Level BPs.\n\n3.  **Performance First**:\n    *   **Tick**: Disable Ticking (`bCanEverTick = false`) by default. Only enable it if absolutely necessary. Prefer timers (`GetWorldTimerManager()`) or event-driven logic.\n    *   **Casting**: Avoid `Cast<T>()` in hot loops. Cache references in `BeginPlay`.\n    *   **Structs vs Classes**: Use `F` structs for data-heavy, non-UObject types to reduce overhead.\n\n## Naming Conventions (Strict)\n\nFollow Epic Games'' coding standard:\n\n*   **Templates**: Prefix with `T` (e.g., `TArray`, `TMap`).\n*   **UObject**: Prefix with `U` (e.g., `UCharacterMovementComponent`).\n*   **AActor**: Prefix with `A` (e.g., `AMyGameMode`).\n*   **SWidget**: Prefix with `S` (Slate widgets).\n*   **Structs**: Prefix with `F` (e.g., `FVector`).\n*   **Enums**: Prefix with `E` (e.g., `EWeaponState`).\n*   **Interfaces**: Prefix with `I` (e.g., `IInteractable`).\n*   **Booleans**: Prefix with `b` (e.g., `bIsDead`).\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### 1. Robust Component Lookup\nAvoid `GetComponentByClass` in `Tick`. Do it in `PostInitializeComponents` or `BeginPlay`.\n\n```cpp\nvoid AMyCharacter::PostInitializeComponents() {\n    Super::PostInitializeComponents();\n    HealthComp = FindComponentByClass<UHealthComponent>();\n    check(HealthComp); // Fail hard in dev if missing\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Interface Implementation\nUse interfaces to decouple systems (e.g., Interaction system).\n\n```cpp\n// Interface call check\nif (TargetActor->Implements<UInteractable>()) {\n    IInteractable::Execute_OnInteract(TargetActor, this);\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Async Loading (Soft References)\nAvoid hard references (`UPROPERTY(EditDefaultsOnly) TSubclassOf<AActor>`) for massive assets which force load orders. Use `TSoftClassPtr` or `TSoftObjectPtr`.\n\n```cpp\nUPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, BlueprintReadWrite)\nTSoftClassPtr<AWeapon> WeaponClassToLoad;\n\nvoid AMyCharacter::Equip() {\n    if (WeaponClassToLoad.IsPending()) {\n        WeaponClassToLoad.LoadSynchronous(); // Or use StreamableManager for async\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n*   **Logging**: Use `UE_LOG` with custom categories.\n    ```cpp\n    DEFINE_LOG_CATEGORY_STATIC(LogMyGame, Log, All);\n    UE_LOG(LogMyGame, Warning, TEXT(\"Health is low: %f\"), CurrentHealth);\n    ```\n*   **Screen Messages**:\n    ```cpp\n    if (GEngine) GEngine->AddOnScreenDebugMessage(-1, 5.f, FColor::Red, TEXT(\"Died!\"));\n    ```\n*   **Visual Logger**: extremely useful for AI debugging. Implement `IVisualLoggerDebugSnapshotInterface`.\n\n## Checklist before PR\n\n- [ ] Does this Actor need to Tick? Can it be a Timer?\n- [ ] Are all `UObject*` members wrapped in `UPROPERTY`?\n- [ ] Are hard references (TSubclassOf) causing load chains? Can they be Soft Ptrs?\n- [ ] Did you clean up verified delegates in `EndPlay`?\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:19.903Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Game Development Agents needing expert Unreal Engine 5 C++ guidance for performance optimization and memory leak debugging.","zh":"非常适合需要 Unreal Engine 5 C++ 专家指导以进行性能优化和内存泄漏调试的游戏开发代理。","ja":"Unreal Engine 5 の C++ 専門のガイダンスが必要なゲーム開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Unreal Engine 5 C++ 전문가 지침이 필요한 게임 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de juegos que necesitan orientación experta en Unreal Engine 5 C++ para la optimización del rendimiento y la depuración de fugas de memoria.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de jeux ayant besoin de conseils d''experts sur Unreal Engine 5 C++ pour l''optimisation des performances et le débogage des fuites de mémoire.","de":"Perfekt für Game-Development-Agents, die Experten-Anleitung für Unreal Engine 5 C++ zur Leistungsoptimierung und Speicherleck-Debugging benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Jogos que precisam de orientação de especialista em Unreal Engine 5 C++ para otimização de desempenho e depuração de vazamentos de memória.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки игр, которым требуется экспертное руководство по Unreal Engine 5 C++ для оптимизации производительности и отладки утечек памяти.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير الألعاب الذي يحتاج إلى إرشادات خبيرة في Unreal Engine 5 C++ لتحسين الأداء وتصحيح أخطاء تسرب الذاكرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write robust, performant, and standard-compliant C++ code for Unreal Engine 5, leveraging Actors, Components, and UObject-derived classes, while optimizing performance-critical code and debugging memory leaks using C++11/C++14 features.","zh":"赋予代理编写强健、高效、标准兼容的 Unreal Engine 5 C++ 代码的能力，利用 Actors、Components 和 UObject 派生类，同时优化性能关键代码和使用 C++11/C++14 功能调试内存泄漏。","ja":"Unreal Engine 5 の強健で高性能で標準準拠の C++ コードを記述するエージェントに力を与え、Actor、Component、および UObject 派生クラスを活用し、C++11/C++14 機能を使用してパフォーマンスクリティカルコードを最適化し、メモリ漏れをデバッグします。","ko":"에이전트가 강력하고 효율적이며 표준을 준수하는 Unreal Engine 5 C++ 코드를 작성할 수 있도록 해주며, Actor, Component 및 UObject 파생 클래스를 활용하여 C++11/C++14 기능을 사용하여 성능에 중요한 코드를 최적화하고 메모리 누수를 디버깅합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir código C++ robusto, eficiente y compatible con los estándares para Unreal Engine 5, aprovechando Actores, Componentes y clases derivadas de UObject, al mismo tiempo que se optimiza el código crítico para el rendimiento y se depuran las fugas de memoria utilizando características de C++11/C++14.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire du code C++ robuste, performant et conforme aux normes pour Unreal Engine 5, en exploitant les Acteurs, les Composants et les classes dérivées de UObject, tout en optimisant le code critique pour les performances et en déboguant les fuites de mémoire à l''aide des fonctionnalités C++11/C++14.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, robusten, leistungsfähigen und standardkonformen C++-Code für Unreal Engine 5 zu schreiben, indem sie Actors, Components und UObject-abgeleitete Klassen nutzen und gleichzeitig performance-kritisches Code optimieren und Speicherlecks unter Verwendung von C++11/C++14-Features debuggen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código C++ robusto, performático e compatível com os padrões para Unreal Engine 5, utilizando Actors, Components e classes derivadas de UObject, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza o código crítico de desempenho e depura vazamentos de memória usando recursos do C++11/C++14.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать прочный, производительный и соответствующий стандартам код C++ для Unreal Engine 5, используя Actors, Components и классы, производные от UObject, а также оптимизирует критический для производительности код и отладывает утечки памяти с использованием возможностей C++11/C++14.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بكتابة شفرة C++ قوية وذكية ومطابقة للمعايير لمحرك Unreal Engine 5، باستخدام Actors و Components و فئات مشتقة من UObject، مع تحسين الكود الحرج للأداء وتصحيح أخطاء تسرب الذاكرة باستخدام ميزات C++11/C++14."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing high-performance C++ code for Unreal Engine 5.x projects","Debugging memory leaks and garbage collection issues in Unreal Engine","Implementing Blueprint-exposed functionality using C++","Optimizing performance-critical code in Unreal Engine using C++"],"zh":["为 Unreal Engine 5.x 项目开发高性能 C++ 代码","调试 Unreal Engine 中的内存泄漏和垃圾回收问题","使用 C++ 实现 Blueprint 公开功能","使用 C++ 优化 Unreal Engine 中的性能关键代码"],"ja":["Unreal Engine 5.x プロジェクトのための高性能 C++ コードの開発","Unreal Engine のメモリ漏れとガベージコレクションの問題のデバッグ","C++ を使用した Blueprint 公開機能の実装","C++ を使用した Unreal Engine のパフォーマンスクリティカルコードの最適化"],"ko":["Unreal Engine 5.x 프로젝트를 위한 고성능 C++ 코드 개발","Unreal Engine의 메모리 누수 및 가비지 수집 문제 디버깅","C++를 사용한 블루프린트 노출 기능 구현","C++를 사용한 Unreal Engine의 성능에 중요한 코드 최적화"],"es":["Desarrollar código C++ de alto rendimiento para proyectos Unreal Engine 5.x","Depurar fugas de memoria y problemas de recolección de basura en Unreal Engine","Implementar funcionalidades expuestas mediante Blueprint utilizando C++","Optimizar código crítico para el rendimiento en Unreal Engine utilizando C++"],"fr":["Développer du code C++ haute performance pour les projets Unreal Engine 5.x","Déboguer les fuites de mémoire et les problèmes de collecte de garbage dans Unreal Engine","Implémenter des fonctionnalités exposées via Blueprint en utilisant C++","Optimiser le 