 및 YAML 프론트 매터 메타데이터 추출을 지원합니다.","es":"doc-indexer es un skill que indexa la documentación de proyectos en tiempo real para mejorar la eficiencia","fr":"doc-indexer est un skill qui indexe la documentation de projets en temps réel pour améliorer l''efficacité","de":"doc-indexer ist ein Skill, der die Projektdokumentation in Echtzeit indexiert, um die Effizienz zu verbessern","pt":"O doc-indexer é uma ferramenta de indexação de documentos que extrai metadados de arquivos Markdown e retorna uma mapa estruturada de documentação disponível.","ru":"ИИ Агент doc-indexer - это плагин, который извлекает метаданные из файлов Markdown и возвращает структурированную карту доступной документации.","ar":"أداة فهرسة الوثائق doc-indexer هي أداة تستخرج البيانات الوصفية من ملفات Markdown وتعيد خريطة معدة من الوثائق المتاحة."},"features":{"en":["Scans all markdown files in the `docs/` directory","Extracts YAML frontmatter metadata","Returns a structured map of available documentation","Supports GitHub integration for comprehensive development workflow","Enables efficient discovery of specs, plans, retrospectives, and other documentation","Minimizes token usage by not loading full file content into the context window"],"zh":["支持 Markdown 文件扫描","YAML 前置元数据提取","GitHub 集成","Sprint 管理","实时项目文档上下文"],"ja":["Markdown ファイルのスキャン","YAML フロントマターのメタデータ抽出","GitHub 統合","スプリント管理","プロジェクト文書化の実時間上下文"],"ko":["Markdown 파일 스캔","YAML 프론트 매터 메타데이터 추출","GitHub 통합","스프린트 관리","프로젝트 문서화 실시간 컨텍스트"],"es":["Indexación de documentación en tiempo real","Integración con GitHub","Gestión de sprints","Soporte para migraciones brownfield","Extracción de metadatos YAML de archivos markdown"],"fr":["Indexation de la documentation en temps réel","Intégration avec GitHub","Gestion de sprints","Support pour les migrations brownfield","Extraction de métadonnées YAML de fichiers markdown"],"de":["Echtzeit-Indexierung der Dokumentation","Integration mit GitHub","Sprint-Management","Unterstützung für Brownfield-Migrationen","Extraktion von YAML-Metadaten aus Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Indexação de arquivos Markdown","Extração de metadados YAML","Retorno de mapa estruturada de documentação","Integração com GitHub","Suporte à migração de campos marrons"],"ru":["Индексация файлов Markdown","Извлечение метаданных YAML","Возвращение структурированной карты документации","Интеграция с GitHub","Поддержка миграции полей Brownfield"],"ar":["فهرسة ملفات Markdown","استخراج البيانات الوصفية YAML","إرجاع خريطة معدة من الوثائق","التكامل مع GitHub","دعم هجرة الحقول البنية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use doc-indexer","what is doc-indexer","doc-indexer alternative","doc-indexer vs GitHub workflow","doc-indexer install","doc-indexer setup guide","doc-indexer for AI agents","GitHub integration with doc-indexer","Spec-Driven Git Workflow with doc-indexer"],"zh":["Doc-Indexer","AIエージェント","Spec-Driven Git Workflow","GitHub 集成","Sprint 管理","Markdown 文件扫描","YAML 前置元数据提取"],"ja":["Doc-Indexer","AIエージェント","Spec-Driven Git Workflow","GitHub 統合","スプリント管理","Markdown ファイルのスキャン","YAML フロントマターのメタデータ抽出"],"ko":["Doc-Indexer","AI 도구","Spec-Driven Git Workflow","GitHub 통합","스프린트 관리","Markdown 파일 스캔","YAML 프론트 매터 메타데이터 추출"],"es":["doc-indexer","flujo de trabajo de Git","GitHub","Claude Code","herramientas de desarrollo","indexación de documentación","gestión de sprints","migraciones brownfield"],"fr":["doc-indexer","flux de travail Git","GitHub","Claude Code","outils de développement","indexation de la documentation","gestion de sprints","migrations brownfield"],"de":["doc-indexer","Git-Workflow","GitHub","Claude Code","Entwicklungstools","Dokumentenindexierung","Sprint-Management","Brownfield-Migrationen"],"pt":["doc-indexer","ferramenta de indexação de documentos","desenvolvedores","GitHub","integração","migração de campos marrons","arquivos Markdown","metadados YAML"],"ru":["ИИ Агент doc-indexer","плагин для Claude Code","ИИ Агенты","GitHub","интеграция","миграция полей Brownfield","файлы Markdown","метаданные YAML"],"ar":["أداة فهرسة الوثائق doc-indexer","أداة فهرسة الوثائق","العاملين بالتكنولوجيا","GitHub","التكامل","هجرة الحقول البنية","ملفات Markdown","البيانات الوصفية YAML"]}},"owner":"bodangren","repo":"git-workflow","repoPath":"bodangren/git-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.615Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-indexer","description":"Use this skill at the beginning of any session or when needing to understand available project documentation. Provides just-in-time context by scanning YAML frontmatter from all markdown files in the docs/ directory without loading full content.","bodyPreview":"# Document Indexer Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide just-in-time context about available project documentation without loading full file content into the context window. The doc-indexer scans all markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extracts their YAML frontmatter metadata, and returns a structured map of available documentation. This enables efficient discovery of specs, plans, retrospectives, and other documentation while minimizing token usage.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill in the following s","body":"# Document Indexer Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvide just-in-time context about available project documentation without loading full file content into the context window. The doc-indexer scans all markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extracts their YAML frontmatter metadata, and returns a structured map of available documentation. This enables efficient discovery of specs, plans, retrospectives, and other documentation while minimizing token usage.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill in the following situations:\n\n- At the beginning of any work session to understand the current state of documentation\n- When starting work on a new issue to identify relevant specs and context\n- Before proposing changes to understand existing specifications\n- When planning a sprint to review available approved specs\n- Anytime you need an overview of project documentation without reading full files\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- The project must have a `docs/` directory\n- Documentation files should follow the convention of including YAML frontmatter\n- The `jq` tool is NOT required (script works without it)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Run the Documentation Scanner\n\nExecute the helper script to scan all markdown files in the docs/ directory:\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh\n```\n\nThis will output a human-readable summary showing each document''s frontmatter metadata.\n\nFor machine-readable JSON output (useful for programmatic processing):\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh -j\n```\n\n### Step 2: Review the Documentation Map\n\nThe scanner returns information about all markdown files found in `docs/`, including:\n\n- **File path**: Location of the documentation file\n- **Frontmatter metadata**: Key-value pairs from YAML frontmatter (title, status, type, etc.)\n- **Compliance warnings**: Files missing YAML frontmatter are flagged\n\n**Example human-readable output**:\n```\n---\nfile: docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\ntitle: AgenticDev Methodology\nstatus: approved\ntype: spec\n---\nfile: docs/changes/my-feature/proposal.md\ntitle: My Feature Proposal\nstatus: in-review\ntype: proposal\n[WARNING] Non-compliant file (no frontmatter): docs/README.md\n```\n\n**Example JSON output**:\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"file\": \"docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\",\n    \"compliant\": true,\n    \"frontmatter\": {\n      \"title\": \"AgenticDev Methodology\",\n      \"status\": \"approved\",\n      \"type\": \"spec\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"file\": \"docs/README.md\",\n    \"compliant\": false,\n    \"frontmatter\": null\n  }\n]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Use the Map to Identify Relevant Documentation\n\nBased on the documentation map, identify which specific files to read for your current task:\n\n- **For implementation work**: Look for approved specs related to your issue\n- **For spec proposals**: Review existing specs to understand the current state\n- **For sprint planning**: Identify approved specs ready for implementation\n- **For learning context**: Find retrospectives and design docs\n\n### Step 4: Read Specific Documentation Files\n\nOnce you''ve identified relevant files from the map, use the Read tool to load their full content:\n\n```bash\n# Example: Read a specific spec identified from the map\nRead docs/specs/001-synthesis-flow.md\n```\n\nThis two-step approach (scan first, then read selectively) minimizes token usage while ensuring you have access to all necessary context.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No docs/ Directory\n\n**Symptom**: Script reports \"No such file or directory\"\n\n**Solution**:\n- Verify you''re in the project root directory\n- Check if the project has been initialized with `project-init` skill\n- Create `docs/` directory structure if needed\n\n### Files Missing Frontmatter\n\n**Symptom**: Script outputs \"[WARNING] Non-compliant file (no frontmatter): ...\"\n\n**Impact**: These files won''t have structured metadata in the output\n\n**Solution**:\n- Add YAML frontmatter to documentation files for better discoverability\n- Frontmatter should be at the top of the file between `---` markers\n- Example format:\n  ```markdown\n  ---\n  title: My Document\n  status: draft\n  type: design\n  ---\n\n  # Document content starts here\n  ```\n\n### Script Permission Errors\n\n**Symptom**: \"Permission denied\" when running the script\n\n**Solution**:\n```bash\nchmod +x scripts/scan-docs.sh\n```\n\n## Output Interpretation Guide\n\n### Frontmatter Fields\n\nCommon frontmatter fields you''ll encounter:\n\n- **title**: Human-readable document title\n- **status**: Document state (draft, in-review, approved, archived)\n- **type**: Document category (spec, proposal, design, retrospective, plan)\n- **epic**: Associated epic issue number\n- **sprint**: Sprint identifier\n- **author**: Document author\n- **created**: Creation date\n- **updated**: Last update date\n\n### Using JSON Output Programmatically\n\nThe JSON output mode is particularly useful when:\n\n- Filtering documents by specific criteria (e.g., only approved specs)\n- Counting documents by type or status\n- Building automated workflows\n- Integrating with other tools\n\nExample using `jq` to filter approved specs:\n```bash\nbash scripts/scan-docs.sh -j | jq ''.[] | select(.frontmatter.status == \"approved\")''\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- The scanner is non-invasive and read-only - it never modifies files\n- Large projects with many docs benefit most from this just-in-time approach\n- The script scans recursively through all subdirectories in `docs/`\n- Empty frontmatter sections are treated as non-compliant\n- The scan is fast and can be run frequently without performance concerns\n- Consider running this at the start of each work session to stay current with documentation changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:34.978Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents requiring efficient project documentation discovery and metadata extraction from markdown files","zh":"适用于需要高效的项目文档发现和元数据提取的开发者代理，特别是从markdown文件中","ja":"開発者エージェントがプロジェクトのドキュメントを効率的に発見し、Markdownファイルからメタデータを抽出する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"개발자 에이전트에게 프로젝트 문서를 효율적으로 발견하고 markdown 파일에서 메타데이터를 추출하는 데 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren una descubierta y extracción eficientes de documentación de proyectos y metadatos de archivos markdown","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développeur nécessitant une découverte et une extraction efficaces de la documentation de projet et des métadonnées de fichiers markdown","de":"Ideal für Entwickleragenten, die eine effiziente Projektdokumentation und Metadatenextraktion aus Markdown-Dateien erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que requerem descoberta eficiente de documentação de projeto e extração de metadados de arquivos markdown","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработчиков, требующих эффективного обнаружения документации проекта и извлечения метаданных из файлов markdown","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يتطلب اكتشافا فعالا للوثائق الخاصة بالمشروع واستخراج البيانات الوصفية من الملفات markdown"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scan markdown files in the `docs/` directory, extract YAML frontmatter metadata, and return a structured map of available documentation, minimizing token usage and optimizing spec, plan, and retrospective discovery through markdown file analysis","zh":"赋予代理扫描`docs/`目录中的markdown文件、提取YAML前置元数据，并返回可用文档的结构化映射，最大限度地减少令牌使用并通过markdown文件分析优化规格、计划和回顾发现","ja":"エージェントが`docs/`ディレクトリ内のMarkdownファイルをスキャンし、YAMLフロントマターのメタデータを抽出し、使用可能なドキュメントの構造化マップを返すことで、トークンの使用を最小限に抑え、Markdownファイルの分析を介して仕様、計画、および回顧の発見を最適化","ko":"에이전트가 `docs/` 디렉토리 내의 markdown 파일을 스캔하고 YAML 프론티어 메타데이터를 추출하여 사용 가능한 문서의 구조화된 맵을 반환함으로써 토큰 사용을 최소화하고 markdown 파일 분석을 통해 사양, 계획 및 회고 발견을 최적화","es":"Permite a los agentes escanear archivos markdown en el directorio `docs/`, extraer metadatos de YAML frontmatter y devolver un mapa estructurado de documentación disponible, minimizando el uso de tokens y optimizando la descubierta de especificaciones, planes y retrospectivas a través del análisis de archivos markdown","fr":"Permet aux agents de scanner les fichiers markdown dans le répertoire `docs/`, d''extraire les métadonnées de YAML frontmatter et de renvoyer une carte structurée de la documentation disponible, en minimisant l''utilisation de tokens et en optimisant la découverte de spécifications, de plans et de retrospectives via l''analyse de fichiers markdown","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Markdown-Dateien im `docs/`-Verzeichnis zu scannen, YAML-Frontmatter-Metadaten zu extrahieren und eine strukturierte Karte der verfügbaren Dokumentation zurückzugeben, wodurch die Tokenverwendung minimiert und die Spezifikations-, Plan- und Retrospektivenerkennung durch die Analyse von Markdown-Dateien optimiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a digitalizar arquivos markdown no diretório `docs/`, extrair metadados de frontmatter YAML, e retornar um mapa estruturado da documentação disponível, minimizando o uso de tokens e otimizando a descoberta de especificações, planos e retrospectivas por meio da análise de arquivos markdown","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью сканировать файлы markdown в директории `docs/`, извлекать метаданные из YAML-заголовков, и возвращать структурированную карту доступной документации, минимизируя использование токенов и оптимизируя открытие спецификаций, планов и ретроспектив посредством анализа файлов markdown","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على مسح الملفات markdown في الدليل `docs/` ، واستخراج البيانات الوصفية من YAML frontmatter ، وإرجاع خريطة بنية للوثائق المتاحة ، وتقليل استخدام الرموز وتحسين اكتشاف المواصفات والخطط والاسترجاعات من خلال تحليل الملفات markdown"},"useCases":{"en":["Indexing project documentation for just-in-time context","Extracting YAML frontmatter metadata from markdown files","Enabling efficient discovery of specs, plans, and retrospectives"],"zh":["为即时上下文编制项目文档索引","从markdown文件中提取YAML前置元数据","通过markdown文件分析实现规格、计划和回顾的高效发现"],"ja":["タイムリーなコンテキストのためにプロジェクトのドキュメントをインデックス化する","MarkdownファイルからYAMLフロントマターのメタデータを抽出する","Markdownファイルの分析を介して仕様、計画、および回顧の効率的な発見を実現する"],"ko":["실시간 컨텍스트를 위한 프로젝트 문서 인덱싱","markdown 파일에서 YAML 프론티어 메타데이터 추출","markdown 파일 분석을 통해 사양, 계획 및 회고의 효율적인 발견"],"es":["Indexación de documentación de proyectos para contexto en tiempo real","Extracción de metadatos de YAML frontmatter de archivos markdown","Habilitación de la descubierta eficiente de especificaciones, planes y retrospectivas"],"fr":["Indexation de la documentation de projet pour un contexte en temps réel","Extraction de métadonnées de YAML frontmatter de fichiers markdown","Activation de la découverte efficace de spécifications, de plans et de retrospectives"],"de":["Indexierung von Projektdokumentationen für Kontext in Echtzeit","Extraktion von YAML-Frontmatter-Metadaten aus Markdown-Dateien","Ermöglichung der effizienten Erkennung von Spezifikationen, Plänen und Retrospektiven"],"pt":["Indexação da documentação do projeto para contexto em tempo real","Extração de metadados de frontmatter YAML de arquivos markdown","Habilitação da descoberta eficiente de especificações, planos e retrospectivas"],"ru":["Индексация документации проекта для контекста в реальном времени","Извлечение метаданных из YAML-заголовков файлов markdown","Включение эффективного обнаружения спецификаций, планов и ретроспектив"],"ar":["فهرسة وثائق المشروع للسياق في الوقت الفعلي","استخراج البيانات الوصفية من YAML frontmatter من الملفات markdown","تمكين اكتشاف فعال للمواصفات والخطط والاسترجاعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the `docs/` directory","Limited to markdown files with YAML frontmatter metadata"],"zh":["需要访问`docs/`目录","仅限于具有YAML前置元数据的markdown文件"],"ja":["`docs/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","YAMLフロントマターのメタデータを含むMarkdownファイルのみに限定"],"ko":["`docs/` 디렉토리 접근이 필요","YAML 프론티어 메타데이터를 포함하는 markdown 파일에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `docs/`","Limitado a archivos markdown con metadatos de YAML frontmatter"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `docs/`","Limité aux fichiers markdown avec des métadonnées de YAML frontmatter"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das `docs/`-Verzeichnis","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter-Metadaten"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `docs/`","Limitado a arquivos markdown com metadados de frontmatter YAML"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории `docs/`","Ограничен файлами markdown с метаданными из YAML-заголовков"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `docs/`","محدود بالملفات markdown التي تحتوي على بيانات وصفية من YAML frontmatter"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c644f16429f24e3e1e180220fd4eb9fa0703c69d4884b344185d342bb923b753","qualityScore":51}');
