INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('zzstoatzz/pdsx/cli', 'cli', 'zzstoatzz', 'pdsx', 'community', 'cli zzstoatzz pdsx community The cli skill enables ATProto record CRUD operations for developers, allowing them to perform create, read, update, and delete actions using uvx pdsx commands CLI 用于 ATProto 记录 CRUD 操作，支持读取和写入操作 CLI は ATProto レコードの CRUD 操作をサポートします CLI는 ATProto 레코드 CRUD 연산을 지원합니다 La CLI de ATProto permite operaciones de registro CRUD con autenticación y comandos personalizados. Utilice comandos como `uvx pdsx` para interactuar con el registro. La CLI d''ATProto permet des opérations de registre CRUD avec authentification et commandes personnalisées. Utilisez des commandes comme `uvx pdsx` pour interagir avec le registre. Die ATProto-CLI ermöglicht CRUD-Registrierungsoperationen mit Authentifizierung und benutzerdefinierten Befehlen. Verwenden Sie Befehle wie `uvx pdsx`, um mit dem Register zu interagieren. A CLI do ATProto permite operações de CRUD em registros com autenticação e comandos personalizados ИИ Агент CLI для ATProto позволяет выполнять операции CRUD с записями, используя аутентификацию и настраиваемые команды واجهة سطر الأوامر CLI للات بروتو تسمح بالعمليات CRUD على السجلات باستخدام المصادقة والأوامر المخصصة how to use cli for ATProto cli vs ATProto API cli install guide what is cli in ATProto cli alternative for record operations cli setup for ATProto development ATProto record CRUD tutorial cli authentication for ATProto uvx pdsx commands for cli CLI ATProto CRUD 操作 命令行工具 环境变量 认证 AI 工具 AI开发 Supports ATProto record CRUD operations using uvx pdsx commands Enables authentication for write operations using --handle and --password Allows setting environment variables ATPROTO_HANDLE and ATPROTO_PASSWORD Performs read operations without authentication using -r/--repo Supports creating records with custom text using the create command Lists records using the ls command cli is a command-line interface for ATProto record operations, providing a straightforward way to interact with ATProto records using uvx pdsx');
