as de aplicaciones web con Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents d''IA pour les tests d''applications web","outils de test d''applications web","agents d''IA pour les tests automatisés","alternatives à Selenium","installation d''agents d''IA pour les tests","guide de configuration des agents d''IA","tests d''applications web avec Python","tests d''applications web avec React","tests d''applications web avec Node.js"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten für Webanwendungstests verwendet","Webanwendungstest-Tools","KI-Agenten für automatisierte Tests","Alternativen zu Selenium","Installation von KI-Agenten für Tests","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agenten","Webanwendungstests mit Python","Webanwendungstests mit React","Webanwendungstests mit Node.js"],"pt":["como usar agente de teste de aplicativos web","o que é agente de teste de aplicativos web","agente de teste de aplicativos web alternativa","agente de teste de aplicativos web vs selenium","instalar agente de teste de aplicativos web","guia de configuração do agente de teste de aplicativos web"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты для тестирования веб-приложений","что такое ИИ Агенты для тестирования веб-приложений","ИИ Агенты для тестирования веб-приложений альтернатива","ИИ Агенты для тестирования веб-приложений vs selenium","установить ИИ Агенты для тестирования веб-приложений","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов для тестирования веб-приложений"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء اختبار التطبيقات الويب","ما هو وكيل اختبار التطبيقات الويب","بديل وكلاء اختبار التطبيقات الويب","وكلاء اختبار التطبيقات الويب مقابل سيلينيوم","تثبيت وكلاء اختبار التطبيقات الويب","دليل إعداد وكلاء اختبار التطبيقات الويب"]}},"owner":"dhar174","repo":"langgraph_system_generator","repoPath":"dhar174/langgraph_system_generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.838Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisit","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js installed on the system\n- A locally running web application (or accessible URL)\n- Playwright will be installed automatically if not present\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Browser Automation\n- Navigate to URLs\n- Click buttons and links\n- Fill form fields\n- Select dropdowns\n- Handle dialogs and alerts\n\n### 2. Verification\n- Assert element presence\n- Verify text content\n- Check element visibility\n- Validate URLs\n- Test responsive behavior\n\n### 3. Debugging\n- Capture screenshots\n- View console logs\n- Inspect network requests\n- Debug failed tests\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Example 1: Basic Navigation Test\n```javascript\n// Navigate to a page and verify title\nawait page.goto(''http://localhost:3000'');\nconst title = await page.title();\nconsole.log(''Page title:'', title);\n```\n\n### Example 2: Form Interaction\n```javascript\n// Fill out and submit a form\nawait page.fill(''#username'', ''testuser'');\nawait page.fill(''#password'', ''password123'');\nawait page.click(''button[type=\"submit\"]'');\nawait page.waitForURL(''**/dashboard'');\n```\n\n### Example 3: Screenshot Capture\n```javascript\n// Capture a screenshot for debugging\nawait page.screenshot({ path: ''debug.png'', fullPage: true });\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **Always verify the app is running** - Check that the local server is accessible before running tests\n2. **Use explicit waits** - Wait for elements or navigation to complete before interacting\n3. **Capture screenshots on failure** - Take screenshots to help debug issues\n4. **Clean up resources** - Always close the browser when done\n5. **Handle timeouts gracefully** - Set reasonable timeouts for slow operations\n6. **Test incrementally** - Start with simple interactions before complex flows\n7. **Use selectors wisely** - Prefer data-testid or role-based selectors over CSS classes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern: Wait for Element\n```javascript\nawait page.waitForSelector(''#element-id'', { state: ''visible'' });\n```\n\n### Pattern: Check if Element Exists\n```javascript\nconst exists = await page.locator(''#element-id'').count() > 0;\n```\n\n### Pattern: Get Console Logs\n```javascript\npage.on(''console'', msg => console.log(''Browser log:'', msg.text()));\n```\n\n### Pattern: Handle Errors\n```javascript\ntry {\n  await page.click(''#button'');\n} catch (error) {\n  await page.screenshot({ path: ''error.png'' });\n  throw error;\n}\n```\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Requires Node.js environment\n- Cannot test native mobile apps (use React Native Testing Library instead)\n- May have issues with complex authentication flows\n- Some modern frameworks may require specific configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:46:22.229Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Testing Agents needing advanced browser automation capabilities with Playwright","zh":"非常适合需要高级浏览器自动化功能的前端测试代理，特别是与 Playwright 配合使用","ja":"Playwright を使用した高度なブラウザ自動化機能が必要なフロントエンドテストエージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright 를 사용하는 고급 브라우저 자동화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 테스트 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Pruebas Frontend que necesitan capacidades de automatización de navegador avanzadas con Playwright","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test Frontend ayant besoin de fonctionnalités d''automatisation de navigateur avancées avec Playwright","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Testagenten, die erweiterte Browser-Automatisierungsfunktionen mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste de Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de automação de navegador com Playwright","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов переднего тестирования, требующих расширенных возможностей автоматизации браузера с Playwright","ar":"مثالي لعمليات اختبار الواجهة الأمامية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة في أتمتة المتصفح مع Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate frontend testing, validating UI behavior and interactions, and debugging web application issues using real browser simulations with Playwright automation, capturing screenshots, and inspecting browser console logs","zh":"赋予代理自动化前端测试、验证 UI 行为和交互、并使用 Playwright 自动化进行真实浏览器模拟、捕获屏幕截图以及检查浏览器控制台日志来调试 web 应用程序问题的能力","ja":"エージェントが Playwright 自動化を使用してフロントエンドのテストを自動化し、UI の動作とインタラクションを検証し、Web アプリケーションの問題を実際のブラウザシミュレーションでデバッグし、スクリーンショットをキャプチャし、ブラウザコンソールログを検査する能力を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright 자동화를 사용하여 프론트엔드 테스트를 자동화하고 UI 동작 및 상호작용을 검증하며 웹 애플리케이션 문제를 실제 브라우저 시뮬레이션으로 디버깅하고 스크린샷을 캡처하고 브라우저 콘솔 로그를 검사하는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las pruebas frontend, validar el comportamiento de la interfaz de usuario y las interacciones, y depurar problemas de aplicaciones web utilizando simulaciones de navegador reales con automatización de Playwright, capturando capturas de pantalla e inspeccionando registros de la consola del navegador","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests frontend, de valider le comportement de l''interface utilisateur et les interactions, et de déboguer les problèmes d''applications web en utilisant des simulations de navigateur réelles avec l''automatisation de Playwright, en capturant des captures d''écran et en inspectant les journaux de la console du navigateur","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Frontend-Tests zu automatisieren, das Verhalten der Benutzeroberfläche und die Interaktionen zu überprüfen und Probleme mit Webanwendungen mithilfe von echten Browser-Simulationen mit Playwright-Automatisierung, Screenshots erfassen und Browser-Konsole-Protokolle untersuchen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de frontend, validar o comportamento da interface do usuário e interações, e depurar problemas de aplicativos da web usando simulações de navegador reais com automação Playwright, capturando telas e inspecionando logs de console do navegador","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование frontend, проверять поведение пользовательского интерфейса и взаимодействия, а также отлаживать проблемы веб-приложений с помощью реальных симуляций браузера с автоматизацией Playwright, захватывая экраны и осматривая журналы консоли браузера","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من أتمتة اختبار الواجهة الأمامية، وتصديق سلوك الواجهة والتفاعلات، وتصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الويب باستخدام محاكاة متصفح حقيقي مع أتمتة Playwright، وتسجيل الشاشة، وفحص سجلات konzol المتصفح"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frontend functionality tests in real browser environments","Debugging web application issues through browser console log inspection","Validating form submissions and user flows across different viewports"],"zh":["在真实浏览器环境中自动化前端功能测试","通过浏览器控制台日志检查来调试 web 应用程序问题","在不同视口中验证表单提交和用户流"],"ja":["実際のブラウザ環境でフロントエンドの機能テストを自動化する","ブラウザコンソールログの検査を通じて Web アプリケーションの問題をデバッグする","さまざまなビューポートでフォームの提出とユーザーフローを検証する"],"ko":["실제 브라우저 환경에서 프론트엔드 기능 테스트를 자동화하는 것","브라우저 콘솔 로그를 통한 웹 애플리케이션 문제 디버깅","다양한 뷰포트에서 폼 제출 및 사용자 흐름을 검증"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de funcionalidad frontend en entornos de navegador reales","Depurar problemas de aplicaciones web a través de la inspección de registros de la consola del navegador","Validar envíos de formularios y flujos de usuario en diferentes puntos de vista"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de fonctionnalité frontend dans des environnements de navigateur réels","Déboguer les problèmes d''applications web par l''inspection des journaux de la console du navigateur","Valider les soumissions de formulaires et les flux d''utilisateur sur différents points de vue"],"de":["Automatisieren von Frontend-Funktionalitätstests in realen Browser-Umgebungen","Beheben von Webanwendungsproblemen durch Untersuchung der Browser-Konsole-Protokolle","Überprüfen von Formulareingaben und Benutzerflüssen auf verschiedenen Ansichtsbereichen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend em ambientes de navegador reais","Depurar problemas de aplicativos da web por meio da inspeção de logs de console do navegador","Validar envios de formulários e fluxos de usuário em diferentes viewport"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование frontend в реальных средах браузера","Отлаживать проблемы веб-приложений путем осмотра журналов консоли браузера","Проверять отправку форм и потоки пользователей на разных viewport"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار الوظائف الأمامية في بيئات متصفح حقيقية","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الويب من خلال فحص سجلات konzol المتصفح","تصديق إرسال النماذج وتدفقات المستخدم عبر مختلف viewport"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright automation setup","Limited to local web application testing"],"zh":["需要 Playwright 自动化设置","仅限本地 web 应用程序测试"],"ja":["Playwright 自動化の設定が必要","ローカル Web アプリケーションのテストに限定"],"ko":["Playwright 자동화 설정이 필요","로컬 웹 애플리케이션 테스트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de automatización de Playwright","Limitado a pruebas de aplicaciones web locales"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''automatisation de Playwright","Limité aux tests d''applications web locales"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright-Automatisierungseinrichtung","Begrenzt auf lokale Webanwendungstests"],"pt":["Exige configuração de automação Playwright","Limitado a testes de aplicativos da web locais"],"ru":["Требует настройки автоматизации Playwright","Ограничен тестированием веб-приложений на местном уровне"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد أتمتة Playwright","محدود لاختبار تطبيقات الويب المحلية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"31e301853c09c350e8a55e8e078a1f6e5873f3cdda6cd05a46ddd3d1f0ab6c61","qualityScore":51}');
