arp","ferramentas de ia para produtividade","alternativas ao keep-clis-sharp","keep-clis-sharp vs outras ferramentas","instalar keep-clis-sharp","guias de configuração do keep-clis-sharp"],"ru":["как использовать keep-clis-sharp","что такое keep-clis-sharp","инструменты ИИ для производительности","альтернативы keep-clis-sharp","keep-clis-sharp vs другие инструменты","установить keep-clis-sharp","руководства по настройке keep-clis-sharp"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام keep-clis-sharp","ما هو keep-clis-sharp","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لتحسين الإنتاجية","بديلات keep-clis-sharp","keep-clis-sharp مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت keep-clis-sharp","دليل إعداد keep-clis-sharp"]}},"owner":"repairman29","repo":"JARVIS","repoPath":"repairman29/JARVIS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T07:37:53.519Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"keep-clis-sharp","description":"Audit and update CLI tools, npm packages, and repo scripts; ensure versions are current and documented. Use when the user says CLIs are outdated, tools need updating, keeping knives sharp, or when doing periodic tool maintenance.","bodyPreview":"# Keep CLIs Sharp (Tool Keeper)\n\nYou are the **tool keeper**: keep repo CLIs, npm deps, and scripts current and documented so JARVIS and humans can rely on them.\n\n## When to use\n\n- User says \"CLIs are outdated\", \"keep our knives sharp\", \"update our tools\", or \"tool maintenance\"\n- Periodic upkeep (e.g. after major Node/npm or platform releases)\n- Before a release or deep-work cycle\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Inventory** — List what to sharpen:\n   - **npm:** Root `package.json`, `apps/jarvis-ui/package.js","body":"# Keep CLIs Sharp (Tool Keeper)\n\nYou are the **tool keeper**: keep repo CLIs, npm deps, and scripts current and documented so JARVIS and humans can rely on them.\n\n## When to use\n\n- User says \"CLIs are outdated\", \"keep our knives sharp\", \"update our tools\", or \"tool maintenance\"\n- Periodic upkeep (e.g. after major Node/npm or platform releases)\n- Before a release or deep-work cycle\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Inventory** — List what to sharpen:\n   - **npm:** Root `package.json`, `apps/jarvis-ui/package.json`, `olive-e2e/package.json`\n   - **Platform CLIs:** Per `jarvis/TOOLS.md` → Platform CLIs (Maestro): Vercel, Railway, Stripe, Fly.io, Supabase, Netlify, Wrangler, Cursor\n   - **Repo scripts:** Prefer scripts in `scripts/`; note any that call external CLIs or pinned versions\n\n2. **Check versions** — Run, then interpret:\n   - **npm (each package root):** `npm outdated` (or `npm ls --depth=0`). Note major vs minor/patch.\n   - **CLIs:** `vercel --version`, `railway --version`, `stripe --version`, `supabase --version`, etc. Compare to latest from docs or `npm view <cli> version` if installed via npm.\n\n3. **Update safely** — Prefer non-breaking first:\n   - **npm:** `npm update` for in-range; for major bumps, update one dependency at a time, run tests, then commit.\n   - **CLIs:** Install/upgrade via official method (e.g. `npm i -g vercel`, `brew upgrade supabase`, or vendor docs). Do not guess; check each CLI’s recommended install/upgrade path.\n\n4. **Document** — Keep the shop ledger:\n   - **jarvis/TOOLS.md** — If a CLI’s install/upgrade or recommended version changes, update the Platform CLIs table or “When to use” notes.\n   - **RUNBOOK.md** — If a script or CLI command changes (e.g. new Supabase CLI flags), update the relevant section.\n   - Optional: add a short “Last sharpened” note in a doc or CHANGELOG with date and what was updated.\n\n## Conducting rules\n\n- **One sweep, then report:** Run the checks; summarize what’s outdated, what you updated, and what you deferred (and why).\n- **No destructive updates without confirmation:** For major version bumps or CLI upgrades that might change behavior, state the risk and ask before applying, or apply and suggest a quick test plan.\n- **Prefer repo scripts:** If a task is already covered by a script in `scripts/`, use it; if an update invalidates a script, update the script and any docs that reference it.\n\n## Quick checklist (copy and track)\n\n```\n- [ ] npm outdated (root, apps/jarvis-ui, olive-e2e)\n- [ ] Platform CLIs: vercel, railway, stripe, supabase, fly, netlify, wrangler — version check\n- [ ] Apply safe npm updates; document major bumps\n- [ ] Update jarvis/TOOLS.md if CLI install/usage changed\n- [ ] Update RUNBOOK.md if script/CLI commands changed\n```\n\n## Reference\n\n- Tool inventory and CLI list: [reference.md](reference.md)\n- Repo scripts and when to use: **jarvis/TOOLS.md** (Repairman29 Repo Automation, Platform CLIs)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T08:58:00.479Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Maintenance Agents needing automated npm dependency updates and CLI tool management.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化npm依赖更新和CLI工具管理的维护代理。","ja":"メンテナンスエージェントがnpm依存関係の自動更新とCLIツールの管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"자동화된 npm 종속성 업데이트와 CLI 도구 관리가 필요한 유지 보수 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de mantenimiento que necesitan actualizaciones de dependencias de npm automatizadas y gestión de herramientas de CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de maintenance qui ont besoin de mises à jour de dépendances npm automatisées et de gestion d''outils de ligne de commande.","de":"Perfekt für Wartungsagenten, die automatisierte npm-Abhängigkeitsupdates und CLI-Tool-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção que necessitam de atualizações automatizadas de dependências npm e gerenciamento de ferramentas CLI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обслуживания, которым необходимы автоматические обновления зависимостей npm и управление инструментами CLI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الصيانة الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات تلقائية لاعتمادية npm وإدارة أدوات CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to keep repository CLIs, npm dependencies, and scripts up-to-date and well-documented, ensuring seamless workflow automation with tools like Node/npm and platform-specific releases, utilizing natural language workflow automation for efficient maintenance.","zh":"赋予代理保持仓库CLIs、npm依存关系和脚本的最新状态和良好的文档记录，确保使用Node/npm和平台特定版本等工具实现无缝的工作流自动化，利用自然语言工作流自动化实现高效的维护。","ja":"エージェントがリポジトリのCLIs、npm依存関係、スクリプトを最新の状態に保ち、適切に文書化することを可能にし、Node/npmやプラットフォーム固有のリリースなどのツールを使用してシームレスなワークフロー自動化を実現し、ナチュラルラーグジーによるワークフロー自動化を使用して効率的なメンテナンスを実現する。","ko":"에이전트가 저장소의 CLIs, npm 종속성, 스크립트를 최신 상태로 유지하고 잘 문서화하여 Node/npm 및 플랫폼별 릴리스와 같은 도구를 사용하여 무중단 워크플로 자동화를 보장하고 자연어 워크플로 자동화를 사용하여 효율적인 유지 보수를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener los CLI del repositorio, las dependencias de npm y los scripts actualizados y bien documentados, garantizando la automatización del flujo de trabajo sin problemas con herramientas como Node/npm y versiones específicas de plataformas, utilizando la automatización del flujo de trabajo de lenguaje natural para un mantenimiento eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir les CLI du référentiel, les dépendances npm et les scripts à jour et bien documentés, garantissant une automation du flux de travail sans problème avec des outils comme Node/npm et des versions spécifiques de plateformes, en utilisant l''automatisation du flux de travail de langage naturel pour un maintien efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Repository-CLIs, npm-Abhängigkeiten und Skripte auf dem neuesten Stand und gut dokumentiert zu halten, und gewährleistet eine reibungslose Automatisierung der Arbeitsabläufe mit Tools wie Node/npm und plattformspezifischen Releases, indem es die natürliche Sprachautomatisierung des Arbeitsablaufs für eine effiziente Wartung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter os CLIs do repositório, dependências npm e scripts atualizados e bem documentados, garantindo automação de fluxo de trabalho sem interrupções com ferramentas como Node/npm e lançamentos específicos de plataforma, utilizando automação de fluxo de trabalho de linguagem natural para manutenção eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать актуальность CLIs репозитория, зависимостей npm и скриптов, обеспечивая бесперебойную автоматизацию рабочих процессов с помощью инструментов seperti Node/npm и выпусков, специфичных для платформы, с использованием автоматизации рабочих процессов естественного языка для эффективного обслуживания.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الحفاظ على CLIs للمستودع واعتمادية npm والبرامج النصية محدثة ومدوّنة جيدًا، مما يضمن автомة سير العمل دون انقطاع مع أدوات مثل Node/npm وإصدارات منصة محددة، باستخدام تلقائية سير العمل للغة الطبيعية من أجل الصيانة الفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating periodic upkeep of npm dependencies","Updating CLIs before major releases or deep-work cycles","Maintaining accurate documentation of repository tools"],"zh":["自动执行npm依存关系的周期性维护","在主要版本发布或深度工作周期之前更新CLIs","保持仓库工具的准确文档记录"],"ja":["npm依存関係の定期的なメンテナンスを自動化する","メジャーリリースや深い作業サイクルの前にCLIsを更新する","リポジトリツールの正確なドキュメントを維持する"],"ko":["npm 종속성의 주기적인 유지 보수를 자동화하기","주요 릴리스 또는 깊은 작업 주기 전에 CLIs를 업데이트하기","저장소 도구의 정확한 문서화를 유지하기"],"es":["Automatización del mantenimiento periódico de dependencias de npm","Actualización de CLIs antes de lanzamientos importantes o ciclos de trabajo intensivo","Mantenimiento de documentación precisa de herramientas de repositorio"],"fr":["Automatisation de la maintenance périodique des dépendances npm","Mise à jour des CLI avant les sorties majeures ou les cycles de travail intensif","Maintenance de la documentation précise des outils de référentiel"],"de":["Automatisierung der regelmäßigen Wartung von npm-Abhängigkeiten","Aktualisierung von CLIs vor großen Releases oder intensiven Arbeitszyklen","Wartung genauer Dokumentation von Repository-Tools"],"pt":["Automatizar a manutenção periódica de dependências npm","Atualizar CLIs antes de lançamentos principais ou ciclos de trabalho profundo","Manter documentação precisa de ferramentas do repositório"],"ru":["Автоматизировать периодическое обслуживание зависимостей npm","Обновлять CLIs перед основными релизами или глубокими циклами работы","Поддерживать точную документацию инструментов репозитория"],"ar":["تحديث دوري لاعتمادية npm","تحديث CLIs قبل الإصدارات الرئيسية أو الدورات العميقة من العمل","الحفاظ على توثيق دقيق لأدوات المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to repository package.json files","Limited to Node/npm and specific platform releases"],"zh":["需要访问仓库package.json文件","仅限Node/npm和特定平台版本"],"ja":["リポジトリのpackage.jsonファイルへのアクセスが必要","Node/npmと特定のプラットフォームバージョンのみ"],"ko":["저장소 package.json 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Node/npm 및 특정 플랫폼 릴리스만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos package.json del repositorio","Limitado a Node/npm y versiones específicas de plataformas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers package.json du référentiel","Limité à Node/npm et aux versions spécifiques de plateformes"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die package.json-Dateien des Repositorys","Begrenzt auf Node/npm und plattformspezifische Releases"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos package.json do repositório","Limitado a Node/npm e lançamentos específicos de plataforma"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам package.json репозитория","Ограничен Node/npm и выпусками, специфичными для платформы"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات package.json للمستودع","محدود بـ Node/npm وإصدارات منصة محددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"70b109328972a1b10e7ede48e48121325ef59c6575de592973a6c4f2af84bdef","qualityScore":51}');
