:Enterprise","installation d''outils d''agents IA","guide de configuration d''agents IA"],"de":["AI-Agenten-Tools","Anwendungsentwicklung von 1C:Enterprise","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","künstliche Intelligenz in der Anwendungsentwicklung","Cursor IDE","Alternativen zu 1C:Enterprise","Installation von AI-Agenten-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für AI-Agenten"],"pt":["ferramentas de agente de IA","desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise","Cursor IDE","como usar 1c-mxl-info","o que é 1c-mxl-info","alternativas ao 1c-mxl-info","1c-mxl-info vs outros","instalar 1c-mxl-info","guia de configuração do 1c-mxl-info"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","разработка 1C:Enterprise","Cursor IDE","как использовать 1c-mxl-info","что такое 1c-mxl-info","альтернативы 1c-mxl-info","1c-mxl-info vs другие","установить 1c-mxl-info","руководство по настройке 1c-mxl-info"],"ar":["أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير 1C:Enterprise","Cursor IDE","كيفية استخدام 1c-mxl-info","ما هو 1c-mxl-info","بديلات 1c-mxl-info","1c-mxl-info مقابل غيره","تثبيت 1c-mxl-info","دليل إعداد 1c-mxl-info"]}},"owner":"Jefest9988","repo":"1c-ai-development-kit","repoPath":"Jefest9988/1c-ai-development-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T13:08:04.272Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"1c-mxl-info","description":"Analyze 1C spreadsheet document (MXL/Template.xml) structure — areas, parameters, column sets. Use to understand layout structure before writing fill code or modifying templates.","bodyPreview":"# 1C MXL Info — Layout Structure Analyzer\n\nReads Template.xml of a spreadsheet document and outputs a compact summary: named areas, parameters, column sets. Replaces the need to read thousands of XML lines.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n1c-mxl-info <TemplatePath>\n1c-mxl-info <ProcessorName> <TemplateName>\n```\n\n| Parameter | Required | Default | Description |\n|-----------|:--------:|---------|-------------|\n| TemplatePath | no | — | Direct path to Template.xml |\n| ProcessorName | no | — | Processor name (altern","body":"# 1C MXL Info — Layout Structure Analyzer\n\nReads Template.xml of a spreadsheet document and outputs a compact summary: named areas, parameters, column sets. Replaces the need to read thousands of XML lines.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n1c-mxl-info <TemplatePath>\n1c-mxl-info <ProcessorName> <TemplateName>\n```\n\n| Parameter | Required | Default | Description |\n|-----------|:--------:|---------|-------------|\n| TemplatePath | no | — | Direct path to Template.xml |\n| ProcessorName | no | — | Processor name (alternative to path) |\n| TemplateName | no | — | Template name (alternative to path) |\n| SrcDir | no | `src` | Source directory |\n| Format | no | `text` | Output format: `text` or `json` |\n| WithText | no | false | Include static text and templates |\n| MaxParams | no | 10 | Max parameters per area in listing |\n| Limit | no | 150 | Max output lines (overflow protection) |\n| Offset | no | 0 | Skip N lines (for pagination) |\n\nSpecify either `-TemplatePath`, or both `-ProcessorName` and `-TemplateName`.\n\n## Command\n\n```powershell\npowershell.exe -NoProfile -File skills/1c-mxl-info/scripts/mxl-info.ps1 -TemplatePath \"<path>\"\n```\n\nOr by processor/template name:\n```powershell\npowershell.exe -NoProfile -File skills/1c-mxl-info/scripts/mxl-info.ps1 -ProcessorName \"<Name>\" -TemplateName \"<Template>\" [-SrcDir \"<dir>\"]\n```\n\nAdditional flags:\n```powershell\n... -WithText              # include text cell content\n... -Format json           # JSON output for programmatic processing\n... -MaxParams 20          # show more parameters per area\n... -Offset 150            # pagination: skip first 150 lines\n```\n\n## Reading the Output\n\n### Areas — Sorted Top to Bottom\n\nAreas are listed in document order (by row position), not alphabetically. This matches the area output order in fill code — top to bottom.\n\n```\n--- Named areas ---\n  Header             Rows     rows 1-4     (1 params)\n  Supplier           Rows     rows 5-6     (1 params)\n  Row                Rows     rows 14-14   (8 params)\n  Total              Rows     rows 16-17   (1 params)\n```\n\nArea types:\n- **Rows** — horizontal area (row range). Access: `Template.GetArea(\"Name\")`\n- **Columns** — vertical area (column range). Access: `Template.GetArea(\"Name\")`\n- **Rectangle** — fixed area (rows + columns). Usually uses a separate column set.\n- **Drawing** — named drawing/barcode.\n\n### Column Sets\n\nWhen the layout has multiple column sets, their sizes are shown in the header and per area:\n\n```\n  Column sets: 7 (default=19 cols + 6 additional)\n    f01e015f...: 17 cols\n    0adf41ed...: 4 cols\n  ...\n  Footer             Rows     rows 30-34  (5 params) [colset 14cols]\n  PageNumbering      Rows     rows 59-59  (0 params) [colset 4cols]\n```\n\n### Intersections\n\nWhen both Rows and Columns areas exist (labels, price tags), the script outputs intersection pairs:\n\n```\n--- Intersections (use with GetArea) ---\n  LabelHeight|LabelWidth\n```\n\nIn BSL: `Template.GetArea(\"LabelHeight|LabelWidth\")`\n\n### Parameters and detailParameter\n\nParameters are listed per area. If a parameter has a `detailParameter` (drill-down), it is shown below:\n\n```\n--- Parameters by area ---\n  Supplier: SupplierPresentation\n    detail: SupplierPresentation->Supplier\n  Row: RowNumber, Product, Quantity, Price, Amount, ... (+3)\n    detail: Product->Nomenclature\n```\n\nThis means: parameter `Product` displays a value, and when clicked opens `Nomenclature` (drill-down object).\n\nIn BSL:\n```bsl\nArea.Parameters.Product = TableRow.Nomenclature;\nArea.Parameters.ProductDrillDown = TableRow.Nomenclature; // detailParameter\n```\n\n### Template Parameters (suffix `[tpl]`)\n\nSome parameters are embedded in template text: `\"Inv No. [InventoryNumber]\"`. They are filled via fillType=Template, not fillType=Parameter. The script always extracts them and marks with suffix `[tpl]`:\n\n```\n  PageNumbering: Number [tpl], Date [tpl], PageNumber [tpl]\n```\n\nIn BSL, template parameters are filled the same way as regular ones:\n```bsl\nArea.Parameters.Number = DocumentNumber;\nArea.Parameters.Date = DocumentDate;\n```\n\nNumeric substitutions like `[5]`, `[6]` (footnote references in official forms) are ignored.\n\n### Text Content (`-WithText`)\n\nShows static text (labels, headers) and template strings with substitutions `[Parameter]`:\n\n```\n--- Text content ---\n  TableHeader:\n    Text: \"No.\", \"Product\", \"Unit\", \"Qty\", \"Price\", \"Amount\"\n  Row:\n    Templates: \"Inv No. [InventoryNumber]\"\n```\n\n- **Text** — static labels (fillType=Text). Useful for understanding column purposes.\n- **Templates** — text with substitutions `[ParameterName]` (fillType=Template). Parameter inside `[]` is filled programmatically.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- **Before writing fill code**: run `1c-mxl-info` to understand area names and parameter lists, then write BSL output code following area order top to bottom\n- **With `-WithText`**: when context is needed — column headers, labels near parameters, template strings\n- **With `-Format json`**: when structured data is needed for programmatic processing\n- **For existing layouts**: analyze loaded or configuration layouts without reading raw XML\n\n## Overflow Protection\n\nOutput is limited to 150 lines by default. When exceeded:\n```\n[TRUNCATED] Shown 150 of 220 lines. Use -Offset 150 to continue.\n```\n\nUse `-Offset N` and `-Limit N` for paginated viewing.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T14:47:41.482Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 1C:Enterprise Development Agents needing streamlined Template.xml analysis and summary generation.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Template.xml分析和摘要生成的1C:Enterprise开发代理。","ja":"1C:Enterprise開発エージェントがTemplate.xml分析とサマリ生成を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"Template.xml 분석 및 요약 생성을 간소화해야 하는 1C:Enterprise 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de 1C:Enterprise que necesitan un análisis simplificado de Template.xml y la generación de resúmenes.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement 1C:Enterprise nécessitant une analyse rationalisée de Template.xml et une génération de résumés.","de":"Perfekt für 1C:Enterprise-Entwicklungs-Agents, die einen optimierten Template.xml-Analyse und die Generierung von Zusammenfassungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise que necessitam de análise e geração de resumo de Template.xml simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки 1C:Enterprise, которым необходима упрощенная анализ и генерация отчетов Template.xml.","ar":"متوافق تمامًا مع وكلاء تطوير 1C:Enterprise الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل وإنشاء ملخصات Template.xml مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to rapidly parse Template.xml files, extracting key information such as named areas, parameters, and column sets, thereby replacing the need to manually read thousands of XML lines and facilitating efficient development within the Cursor IDE ecosystem using MXL files.","zh":"使代理能够快速解析Template.xml文件，提取关键信息（如命名区域、参数和列集），从而取代手动阅读数千行XML的需要，并在使用MXL文件的Cursor IDE生态系统中实现高效开发。","ja":"エージェントがTemplate.xmlファイルを迅速に解析し、命名されたエリア、パラメータ、および列セットなどの重要な情報を抽出することを可能にし、数千行のXMLを手動で読む必要性を排除し、MXLファイルを使用するCursor IDEエコシステム内で効率的な開発を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 Template.xml 파일을 신속하게 구문 분석하여命명된 영역, 매개 변수 및 열 집합과 같은 중요한 정보를 추출할 수 있도록하여 수천 줄의 XML을 수동으로 읽는 필요성을 대체하고 MXL 파일을 사용하는 Cursor IDE 생태계 내에서 효율적인 개발을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar rápidamente archivos Template.xml, extrayendo información clave como áreas nombradas, parámetros y conjuntos de columnas, reemplazando así la necesidad de leer manualmente miles de líneas de XML y facilitando un desarrollo eficiente dentro del ecosistema del IDE Cursor utilizando archivos MXL.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser rapidement les fichiers Template.xml, en extrayant des informations clés telles que les zones nommées, les paramètres et les ensembles de colonnes, remplaçant ainsi le besoin de lire manuellement des milliers de lignes XML et facilitant un développement efficace au sein de l''écosystème Cursor IDE en utilisant des fichiers MXL.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Template.xml-Dateien schnell zu parsen, um wichtige Informationen wie benannte Bereiche, Parameter und Spaltensätze zu extrahieren, wodurch der manuelle Aufwand zum Lesen tausender XML-Zeilen entfällt und eine effiziente Entwicklung innerhalb des Cursor IDE-Ökosystems unter Verwendung von MXL-Dateien gefördert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar rapidamente arquivos Template.xml, extrair informações-chave como áreas nomeadas, parâmetros e conjuntos de colunas, substituindo assim a necessidade de ler manualmente milhares de linhas XML e facilitando o desenvolvimento eficiente dentro do ecossistema do Cursor IDE usando arquivos MXL.","ru":"Позволяет агентам быстро разбирать файлы Template.xml, извлекая ключевую информацию, такую как именованные области, параметры и наборы столбцов, тем самым заменяя необходимость ручного чтения тысяч строк XML и облегчая эффективное развитие в экосистеме Cursor IDE с использованием файлов MXL.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء التحليل السريع لملفات Template.xml واستخراج المعلومات الرئيسية مثل المناطق المسمى والparameters والمجموعات العمودية، مما يلغي الحاجة إلى قراءة آلاف الأسطر من XML يدوياً وتسهيل التطوير الفعال داخل نظام Cursor IDE باستخدام ملفات MXL."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Template.xml layouts for 1C:Enterprise development","Automating summary generation for MXL files","Debugging Template.xml issues by quickly identifying named areas and parameters"],"zh":["分析1C:Enterprise开发的Template.xml布局","自动为MXL文件生成摘要","通过快速识别命名区域和参数来调试Template.xml问题"],"ja":["1C:Enterprise開発のTemplate.xmlレイアウトを分析する","MXLファイルのサマリを自動生成する","命名されたエリアとパラメータを迅速に識別することでTemplate.xmlの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["1C:Enterprise 개발을 위한 Template.xml 레이아웃 분석","MXL 파일에 대한 요약 자동 생성","命名된 영역 및 매개 변수를 신속하게 식별하여 Template.xml 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Analizar diseños de Template.xml para el desarrollo de 1C:Enterprise","Automatizar la generación de resúmenes para archivos MXL","Depurar problemas de Template.xml mediante la identificación rápida de áreas nombradas y parámetros"],"fr":["Analyser les mises en page Template.xml pour le développement 1C:Enterprise","Automatiser la génération de résumés pour les fichiers MXL","Déboguer les problèmes Template.xml en identifiant rapidement les zones nommées et les paramètres"],"de":["Analysieren von Template.xml-Layouts für die 1C:Enterprise-Entwicklung","Automatisieren der Zusammenfassungsgenerierung für MXL-Dateien","Debuggen von Template.xml-Problemen durch schnelles Identifizieren benannter Bereiche und Parameter"],"pt":["Analisar layouts de Template.xml para desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise","Automatizar a geração de resumos para arquivos MXL","Depurar problemas de Template.xml identificando rapidamente áreas nomeadas e parâmetros"],"ru":["Анализ макетов Template.xml для разработки 1C:Enterprise","Автоматизация генерации отчетов для файлов MXL","Отладка проблем Template.xml путем быстрого выявления именованных областей и параметров"],"ar":["تحليل تخطيطات Template.xml لتطوير 1C:Enterprise","تأتمة إنشاء الملخصات لملفات MXL","تصحيح أخطاء Template.xml بالتحديد السريع للمناطق المسمى والparameters"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires direct path to Template.xml or ProcessorName and TemplateName","Specific to 1C:Enterprise development environment"],"zh":["需要Template.xml或ProcessorName和TemplateName的直接路径","特定于1C:Enterprise开发环境"],"ja":["Template.xmlまたはProcessorNameとTemplateNameへの直接パスが必要","1C:Enterprise開発環境に特有"],"ko":["Template.xml 또는 ProcessorName 및 TemplateName에 대한 직접 경로가 필요","1C:Enterprise 개발 환경에 특정"],"es":["Requiere la ruta directa al Template.xml o ProcessorName y TemplateName","Específico del entorno de desarrollo de 1C:Enterprise"],"fr":["Nécessite le chemin d''accès direct au Template.xml ou ProcessorName et TemplateName","Spécifique à l''environnement de développement 1C:Enterprise"],"de":["Erfordert den direkten Pfad zur Template.xml oder ProcessorName und TemplateName","Spezifisch für die 1C:Enterprise-Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Requer caminho direto para Template.xml ou ProcessorName e TemplateName","Específico para ambiente de desenvolvimento 1C:Enterprise"],"ru":["Требует прямого пути к Template.xml или ProcessorName и TemplateName","Конкретно для среды разработки 1C:Enterprise"],"ar":["يتطلب مسار مباشر إلى Template.xml أو ProcessorName وTemplateName","محدد لبيئة تطوير 1C:Enterprise"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"943d19d5b077816a71f6a553379cd4400162ab80ecbd0ae467fb6127b2b3fa06","qualityScore":51}');
