、共有プロジェクトのコンテキストを読み込む AI エージェントです","ko":"Context Loader는 공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로드하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"Context Loader es una habilidad que carga contexto de proyecto para garantizar que Codex CLI tenga los mismos conocimientos que Claude Code","fr":"Context Loader est une compétence qui charge le contexte de projet pour garantir que Codex CLI ait les mêmes connaissances que Claude Code","de":"Context Loader ist eine Fähigkeit, die Projektcontext lädt, um sicherzustellen, dass Codex CLI dieselben Kenntnisse wie Claude Code hat","pt":"O Context Loader é um skill que carrega contexto de projeto de um diretório para garantir que o Codex CLI tenha o mesmo conhecimento que o Claude Code","ru":"Context Loader - это навык, который загружает контекст проекта из директории для обеспечения совместимости с Codex CLI и Claude Code","ar":"معماري لتحميل السياق هو مهارة تقوم بتحميل السياق المشترك من دليل لضمان توافق Codex CLI و Claude Code"},"features":{"en":["Loads coding rules from .claude/rules/ directory","Reads files such as coding-principles.md and dev-environment.md","Ensures Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code","Activates at the beginning of every task to load project context","Supports files like uv, ruff, ty, and pytest requirements"],"zh":["加载共享项目上下文","读取 `.claude/rules/` 目录下的 Coding Rules","支持多 LLM 比较和评估","集成 Codex CLI 和 Claude Code","自动加载项目上下文","支持 uv、ruff、ty、pytest 等开发环境"],"ja":["共有プロジェクトのコンテキストを読み込み","`.claude/rules/` ディレクトリ下的コーディングルールを読み込み","多 LLM 比較と評価をサポート","Codex CLI と Claude Code を統合","プロジェクトのコンテキストを自動的に読み込み","uv、ruff、ty、pytest などの開発環境をサポート"],"ko":["공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트 로드","`.claude/rules/` 디렉토리下的 코딩 규칙 읽기","멀티 LLM 비교 및 평가 지원","Codex CLI와 Claude Code 통합","프로젝트 컨텍스트 자동 로드","uv, ruff, ty, pytest 등의 개발 환경 지원"],"es":["Carga de reglas de codificación desde `.claude/rules/`","Compatibilidad con Codex CLI para escenarios de coaching","Carga de contexto de proyecto desde el directorio `.claude/`","Integración con tecnologías como uv, ruff, ty y pytest","Soporte para la configuración de entornos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Chargement des règles de codage depuis `.claude/rules/`","Compatibilité avec Codex CLI pour les scénarios de coaching","Chargement du contexte de projet depuis le répertoire `.claude/`","Intégration avec des technologies telles que uv, ruff, ty et pytest","Support pour la configuration des environnements de développement"],"de":["Laden von Codierregeln aus `.claude/rules/`","Kompatibilität mit Codex CLI für Coaching-Szenarien","Laden von Projektcontext aus dem Verzeichnis `.claude/`","Integration mit Technologien wie uv, ruff, ty und pytest","Unterstützung für die Konfiguration von Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Carregamento de regras de codificação do diretório .claude/rules/","Compatibilidade com Codex CLI e Claude Code","Suporte a multi-LLM para cenários de treinamento","Leitura de arquivos de regras de codificação e ambiente de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Загрузка правил кодирования из директории .claude/rules/","Совместимость с Codex CLI и Claude Code","Поддержка многоязычных моделей для сценариев обучения","Чтение файлов правил кодирования и среды разработки"],"ar":["تحميل قواعد الترميز من دليل .claude/rules/","التوافق مع Codex CLI و Claude Code","دعم متعدد اللغات لسيناريوهات التدريب","قراءة ملفات قواعد الترميز وبيئة التطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use context-loader","context-loader setup guide","what is context-loader","context-loader alternative","context-loader vs Claude Code","context-loader install","loading shared project context","Codex CLI knowledge synchronization","multi-LLM comparison framework"],"zh":["Context Loader","AI 工具","加载共享项目上下文","Coding Rules","Codex CLI","Claude Code","多 LLM 比较","开发环境","uv","ruff","ty","pytest"],"ja":["Context Loader","AI エージェント","共有プロジェクトのコンテキスト","コーディングルール","Codex CLI","Claude Code","多 LLM 比較","開発環境","uv","ruff","ty","pytest"],"ko":["Context Loader","AI 에이전트","공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트","코딩 규칙","Codex CLI","Claude Code","멀티 LLM 비교","개발 환경","uv","ruff","ty","pytest"],"es":["Context Loader","Herramientas de IA para coaching","Configuración de Codex CLI","Carga de contexto de proyecto","Reglas de codificación","Entornos de desarrollo","uv","ruff","ty","pytest"],"fr":["Context Loader","Outils d''IA pour le coaching","Configuration de Codex CLI","Chargement du contexte de projet","Règles de codage","Environnements de développement","uv","ruff","ty","pytest"],"de":["Context Loader","KI-Tools für Coaching","Konfiguration von Codex CLI","Laden von Projektcontext","Codierregeln","Entwicklungsumgebungen","uv","ruff","ty","pytest"],"pt":["context loader","carregamento de contexto","Codex CLI","Claude Code","multi-LLM","cenários de treinamento","regras de codificação","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Context Loader","загрузка контекста","Codex CLI","Claude Code","многоязычные модели","сценарии обучения","правила кодирования","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["معماري لتحميل السياق","تحميل السياق","Codex CLI","Claude Code","متعدد اللغات","سيناريوهات التدريب","قواعد الترميز","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"miyataSUPER","repo":"ai-kommon-llm-evaluation","repoPath":"miyataSUPER/ai-kommon-llm-evaluation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.572Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-loader","description":"ALWAYS activate this skill at the start of every task. Load project context from .claude/ directory including coding rules, design decisions, and documentation before executing any task.","bodyPreview":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements","body":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements\n├── language.md            # Think in English, respond in Japanese\n├── security.md            # Secrets, validation, SQLi/XSS prevention\n├── testing.md             # TDD, AAA pattern, 80% coverage\n└── codex-delegation.md    # (skip - not relevant for Codex itself)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Load Design Documentation\n\nRead `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md` for:\n- Architecture decisions\n- Implementation patterns\n- Library choices and constraints\n- TODO items and open questions\n\n### Step 3: Check Library Documentation\n\nIf the task involves specific libraries, read relevant files from:\n```\n.claude/docs/libraries/\n```\n\n### Step 4: Execute Task\n\nWith the loaded context, execute the requested task following:\n- Coding principles from rules\n- Design decisions from DESIGN.md\n- Library constraints from docs\n\n## Key Rules to Remember\n\nAfter loading, always follow these principles:\n\n1. **Simplicity first** - Choose readable code over complex\n2. **Single responsibility** - One function/class does one thing\n3. **Type hints required** - All functions need annotations\n4. **Use uv** - Never use pip directly\n5. **Security** - No hardcoded secrets, validate input, parameterize SQL\n\n## Language Protocol\n\n- **Thinking/Reasoning**: English\n- **Code**: English (variables, functions, comments)\n- **User communication**: Japanese (when reporting back through Claude Code)\n\n## Output\n\nAfter loading context, briefly confirm:\n- Rules loaded\n- Design document status\n- Ready to execute task\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T02:07:29.092Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-LLM Comparison Agents needing synchronized knowledge graphs.","zh":"非常适合需要同步知识图的多LLM比较代理。","ja":"同期したノウハグラフを必要とするマルチLLM比較エージェントに最適です。","ko":"同步된 지식 그래프가 필요한 멀티 LLM 비교 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Comparación de Multi-LLM que necesitan gráficos de conocimiento sincronizados.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Comparaison de Multi-LLM nécessitant des graphiques de connaissances synchronisés.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-LLM-Vergleichsagenten, die synchronisierte Wissensgraphen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comparação de Multi-LLM que precisam de grafos de conhecimento sincronizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов сравнения Multi-LLM, требующих синхронизированных графов знаний.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المقارنين متعددة LLM الذين يحتاجون إلى رسوم معرفة متزامنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to load shared project context from .claude/ directories, ensuring consistency with Claude Code through Codex CLI, utilizing files like coding-principles.md and dev-environment.md.","zh":"使代理能够从.claude/目录加载共享的项目上下文，确保通过Codex CLI与Claude Code的一致性，利用如coding-principles.md和dev-environment.md的文件。","ja":"エージェントが.claude/ディレクトリから共有プロジェクトコンテキストを読み込むことを可能にし、Codex CLIを介してClaude Codeとの一貫性を確保します。例えば、coding-principles.mdやdev-environment.mdなどのファイルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 .claude/ 디렉토리에서 공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로드할 수 있도록 하여 Codex CLI를 통해 Claude Code와의 일관성을 보장하며, coding-principles.md 및 dev-environment.md와 같은 파일을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cargar el contexto de proyecto compartido desde directorios .claude/, garantizando la consistencia con Claude Code a través de Codex CLI, utilizando archivos como coding-principles.md y dev-environment.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger le contexte de projet partagé à partir de répertoires .claude/, en garantissant la cohérence avec Claude Code via Codex CLI, en utilisant des fichiers tels que coding-principles.md et dev-environment.md.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den gemeinsamen Projekt-Kontext aus .claude/-Verzeichnissen zu laden, wodurch die Konsistenz mit Claude Code über Codex CLI sichergestellt wird, unter Verwendung von Dateien wie coding-principles.md und dev-environment.md.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a carregar o contexto do projeto compartilhado a partir de diretórios .claude/, garantindo a consistência com o Claude Code por meio do Codex CLI, utilizando arquivos como coding-principles.md e dev-environment.md.","ru":"Позволяет агентам загружать общий контекст проекта из директорий .claude/, обеспечивая согласованность с Claude Code через Codex CLI, используя файлы типа coding-principles.md и dev-environment.md.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحميل سياق المشروع المشترك من مجلدات .claude/، مما يضمن الاتساق مع Claude Code من خلال Codex CLI، بإستخدام ملفات مثل coding-principles.md و dev-environment.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Loading coding rules for multi-LLM evaluation","Ensuring Codex CLI knowledge consistency with Claude Code","Initializing project context for comparison frameworks"],"zh":["加载多LLM评估的编码规则","确保Codex CLI知识与Claude Code的一致性","初始化比较框架的项目上下文"],"ja":["マルチLLM評価のためのコーディングルールを読み込む","Codex CLIの知識とClaude Codeの一貫性を確保する","比較フレームワークのプロジェクトコンテキストを初期化する"],"ko":["멀티 LLM 평가를 위한 코딩 규칙 로드","Codex CLI 지식과 Claude Code의 일관성 보장","비교 프레임워크의 프로젝트 컨텍스트 초기화"],"es":["Carga de reglas de codificación para la evaluación de multi-LLM","Garantizar la consistencia del conocimiento de Codex CLI con Claude Code","Inicialización del contexto de proyecto para frameworks de comparación"],"fr":["Chargement des règles de codage pour l''évaluation de multi-LLM","Assurer la cohérence des connaissances de Codex CLI avec Claude Code","Initialisation du contexte de projet pour les frameworks de comparaison"],"de":["Laden von Codierregeln für die Bewertung von Multi-LLM","Sicherstellen der Konsistenz der Codex-CLI-Kenntnisse mit Claude Code","Initialisierung des Projekt-Kontexts für Vergleichs-Frameworks"],"pt":["Carregar regras de codificação para avaliação de multi-LLM","Garantir a consistência do conhecimento do Codex CLI com o Claude Code","Inicializar o contexto do projeto para estruturas de comparação"],"ru":["Загрузка правил кодирования для оценки multi-LLM","Обеспечение согласованности знаний Codex CLI с Claude Code","Инициализация контекста проекта для сравнительных фреймворков"],"ar":["تحميل قواعد الترميز للتقدير متعدد LLM","ضمان الاتساق في معرفة Codex CLI مع Claude Code","توليد سياق المشروع لإطارات المقارنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .claude/ directory access","Specific to Codex CLI and Claude Code integration"],"zh":[".claude/目录访问是必需的","特定于Codex CLI和Claude Code集成"],"ja":[".claude/ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","Codex CLIとClaude Codeの統合に特有"],"ko":[".claude/ 디렉토리 액세스가 필수입니다","Codex CLI 및 Claude Code 통합에 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio .claude/","Específico para la integración de Codex CLI y Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au répertoire .claude/","Spécifique à l''intégration de Codex CLI et Claude Code"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das .claude/-Verzeichnis","Spezifisch für die Integration von Codex CLI und Claude Code"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório .claude/","Específico para a integração do Codex CLI e Claude Code"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории .claude/","Специфичен для интеграции Codex CLI и Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مجلد .claude/","محدد لتكامل Codex CLI و Claude Code"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"fc5702cb289f89bd6241b217c2ea37004e146944a5ac9814b815a79b78a174b4","qualityScore":51}');
