testing.","zh":"develop-ai-functions-example 是一个用于连接 Mux 视频到多模态 LLMs 的 TypeScript 库","ja":"develop-ai-functions-example は、Mux ビデオを多モーダル LLMs に接続するための TypeScript ライブラリです","ko":"develop-ai-functions-example는 Mux 비디오를 다중 모드 LLMs에 연결하기 위한 TypeScript 라이브러리입니다","es":"Develop-ai-functions-example es una biblioteca de TypeScript para conectar videos de Mux con LLMs multimodales","fr":"Develop-ai-functions-example est une bibliothèque TypeScript pour relier des vidéos Mux à des LLMs multimodaux","de":"Develop-ai-functions-example ist eine TypeScript-Bibliothek, um Videos von Mux mit multimodalen LLMs zu verbinden","pt":"O develop-ai-functions-example é uma biblioteca TypeScript para integração de vídeos com LLMs.","ru":"Develop-ai-functions-example — это библиотека TypeScript для интеграции видео с ИИ Агентами.","ar":"develop-ai-functions-example هي مكتبة بلغة TypeScript لدمج الفيديوهات مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"features":{"en":["Provides scripts for validating and testing AI SDK functions in the examples/ai-functions/ directory","Organizes examples by AI SDK function in examples/ai-functions/src/","Supports non-streaming text generation with generateText() in generate-text/ directory","Includes example categories for different AI SDK functions, such as streaming and non-streaming text generation"],"zh":["支持多模态 LLMs","提供 AI SDK 函数的示例","包含测试和验证脚本","使用 TypeScript 开发","连接 Mux 视频到 LLMs"],"ja":["多モーダル LLMs をサポート","AI SDK 関数の例を提供","テストと検証スクリプトを含む","TypeScript で開発","Mux ビデオを LLMs に接続"],"ko":["다중 모드 LLMs 지원","AI SDK 함수의 예시 제공","테스트 및 검증 스크립트 포함","TypeScript로 개발","Mux 비디오를 LLMs에 연결"],"es":["Conexión de videos de Mux con LLMs multimodales","Ejemplos de funciones de AI para validar y probar SDK de AI","Generación de texto no en streaming con generateText()","Compatibilidad con múltiples proveedores de AI"],"fr":["Connexion de vidéos Mux à des LLMs multimodaux","Exemples de fonctions d''IA pour valider et tester des SDK d''IA","Génération de texte non en streaming avec generateText()","Compatibilité avec plusieurs fournisseurs d''IA"],"de":["Verbindung von Videos von Mux mit multimodalen LLMs","Beispiele für AI-Funktionen, um AI-SDKs zu validieren und zu testen","Generierung von Texten ohne Streaming mit generateText()","Kompatibilität mit mehreren AI-Anbietern"],"pt":["Conexão de vídeos no Mux a LLMs multi-modais","Uso da biblioteca em TypeScript","Geração de texto não em streaming com generateText()","Organização de exemplos por categoria de função do SDK do AI"],"ru":["Подключение видео в Mux к многомодальным LLM","Использование библиотеки на TypeScript","Генерация текста без потoka с помощью generateText()","Организация примеров по категориям функций SDK ИИ"],"ar":["ربط الفيديوهات في Mux مع LLMs متعددة الأوضاع","استخدام المكتبة بلغة TypeScript","ｊنـراجـة النص غير المتدفق مع generateText()","تنظيم الأمثلة حسب فئة وظيفة SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use develop-ai-functions-example","develop-ai-functions-example alternative","develop-ai-functions-example setup guide","what is develop-ai-functions-example","develop-ai-functions-example vs Mux","install develop-ai-functions-example","develop-ai-functions-example TypeScript library","AI SDK integration with Mux","multi-modal LLMs with develop-ai-functions-example"],"zh":["AI 函数开发","Mux 视频连接","多模态 LLMs","TypeScript 库","AI 驱动的视频分析","LLMs 接口","视频分析工具"],"ja":["AI エージェントの開発","Mux ビデオ接続","多モーダル LLMs","TypeScript ライブラリ","AI ドライブのビデオ分析","LLMs インターフェース","ビデオ分析ツール"],"ko":["AI 함수 개발","Mux 비디오 연결","다중 모드 LLMs","TypeScript 라이브러리","AI 기반 비디오 분석","LLMs 인터페이스","비디오 분석 도구"],"es":["agentes de inteligencia artificial","herramientas de IA","develop-ai-functions-example","Mux","LLMs multimodales","TypeScript","generación de texto no en streaming"],"fr":["outils d''IA","agents d''intelligence artificielle","develop-ai-functions-example","Mux","LLMs multimodaux","TypeScript","génération de texte non en streaming"],"de":["KI-Tools","KI-Agenten","develop-ai-functions-example","Mux","multimodale LLMs","TypeScript","Textgenerierung ohne Streaming"],"pt":["develop-ai-functions-example","conexão de vídeos","LLMs multi-modais","TypeScript","geração de texto","Mux","SDK do AI"],"ru":["develop-ai-functions-example","подключение видео","ИИ Агенты","TypeScript","генерация текста","Mux","SDK ИИ"],"ar":["develop-ai-functions-example","ربط الفيديوهات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","TypeScript","ｊنـراجـة النص","Mux","SDK الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"muxinc","repo":"ai","repoPath":"muxinc/ai","stars":57,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T18:53:02Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"develop-ai-functions-example","description":"Develop examples for AI SDK functions. Use when creating, running, or modifying examples under examples/ai-functions/src to validate provider support, demonstrate features, or create test fixtures.","bodyPreview":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stre","body":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stream-text/`     | Streaming text generation with `streamText()`        |\n| `generate-object/` | Structured output generation with `generateObject()` |\n| `stream-object/`   | Streaming structured output with `streamObject()`    |\n| `agent/`           | `ToolLoopAgent` examples for agentic workflows       |\n| `embed/`           | Single embedding generation with `embed()`           |\n| `embed-many/`      | Batch embedding generation with `embedMany()`        |\n| `generate-image/`  | Image generation with `generateImage()`              |\n| `generate-speech/` | Text-to-speech with `generateSpeech()`               |\n| `transcribe/`      | Audio transcription with `transcribe()`              |\n| `rerank/`          | Document reranking with `rerank()`                   |\n| `middleware/`      | Custom middleware implementations                    |\n| `registry/`        | Provider registry setup and usage                    |\n| `telemetry/`       | OpenTelemetry integration                            |\n| `complex/`         | Multi-component examples (agents, routers)           |\n| `lib/`             | Shared utilities (not examples)                      |\n| `tools/`           | Reusable tool definitions                            |\n\n## File Naming Convention\n\nExamples follow the pattern: `{provider}-{feature}.ts`\n\n| Pattern                                  | Example                                    | Description                |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `{provider}.ts`                          | `openai.ts`                                | Basic provider usage       |\n| `{provider}-{feature}.ts`                | `openai-tool-call.ts`                      | Specific feature           |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}.ts`           | `amazon-bedrock-anthropic.ts`              | Provider with sub-provider |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}-{feature}.ts` | `google-vertex-anthropic-cache-control.ts` | Sub-provider with feature  |\n\n## Example Structure\n\nAll examples use the `run()` wrapper from `lib/run.ts` which:\n\n- Loads environment variables from `.env`\n- Provides error handling with detailed API error logging\n\n### Basic Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from \"@ai-sdk/provider-name\";\nimport { generateText } from \"ai\";\n\nimport { run } from \"../lib/run\";\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(\"model-id\"),\n    prompt: \"Your prompt here.\",\n  });\n\n  console.warn(result.text);\n  console.warn(\"Token usage:\", result.usage);\n  console.warn(\"Finish reason:\", result.finishReason);\n});\n```\n\n### Streaming Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from \"@ai-sdk/provider-name\";\nimport { streamText } from \"ai\";\n\nimport { printFullStream } from \"../lib/print-full-stream\";\nimport { run } from \"../lib/run\";\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = streamText({\n    model: providerName(\"model-id\"),\n    prompt: \"Your prompt here.\",\n  });\n\n  await printFullStream({ result });\n});\n```\n\n### Tool Calling Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from \"@ai-sdk/provider-name\";\nimport { generateText, tool } from \"ai\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nimport { run } from \"../lib/run\";\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(\"model-id\"),\n    tools: {\n      myTool: tool({\n        description: \"Tool description\",\n        inputSchema: z.object({\n          param: z.string().describe(\"Parameter description\"),\n        }),\n        execute: async ({ param }) => {\n          return { result: `Processed: ${param}` };\n        },\n      }),\n    },\n    prompt: \"Use the tool to...\",\n  });\n\n  console.warn(JSON.stringify(result, null, 2));\n});\n```\n\n### Structured Output Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from \"@ai-sdk/provider-name\";\nimport { generateObject } from \"ai\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nimport { run } from \"../lib/run\";\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateObject({\n    model: providerName(\"model-id\"),\n    schema: z.object({\n      name: z.string(),\n      items: z.array(z.string()),\n    }),\n    prompt: \"Generate a...\",\n  });\n\n  console.warn(JSON.stringify(result.object, null, 2));\n  console.warn(\"Token usage:\", result.usage);\n});\n```\n\n## Running Examples\n\nFrom the `examples/ai-functions` directory:\n\n```bash\npnpm tsx src/generate-text/openai.ts\npnpm tsx src/stream-text/openai-tool-call.ts\npnpm tsx src/agent/openai-generate.ts\n```\n\n## When to Write Examples\n\nWrite examples when:\n\n1. **Adding a new provider**: Create basic examples for each supported API (`generateText`, `streamText`, `generateObject`, etc.)\n\n2. **Implementing a new feature**: Demonstrate the feature with at least one provider example\n\n3. **Reproducing a bug**: Create an example that shows the issue for debugging\n\n4. **Adding provider-specific options**: Show how to use `providerOptions` for provider-specific settings\n\n5. **Creating test fixtures**: Use examples to generate API response fixtures (see `capture-api-response-test-fixture` skill)\n\n## Utility Helpers\n\nThe `lib/` directory contains shared utilities:\n\n| File                   | Purpose                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `run.ts`               | Error-handling wrapper with `.env` loading               |\n| `print.ts`             | Clean object printing (removes undefined values)         |\n| `print-full-stream.ts` | Colored streaming output for tool calls, reasoning, text |\n| `save-raw-chunks.ts`   | Save streaming chunks for test fixtures                  |\n| `present-image.ts`     | Display images in terminal                               |\n| `save-audio.ts`        | Save audio files to disk                                 |\n\n### Using print utilities\n\n```typescript\nimport { print } from \"../lib/print\";\n\n// Pretty print objects without undefined values\nprint(\"Result:\", result);\nprint(\"Usage:\", result.usage, { depth: 2 });\n```\n\n### Using printFullStream\n\n```typescript\n// import { printFullStream } from ''../lib/print-full-stream'';\n\n// const result = streamText({ ... });\n// await printFullStream({ result }); // Colored output for text, tool calls, reasoning\n```\n\n## Reusable Tools\n\nThe `tools/` directory contains reusable tool definitions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { weatherTool } from \"../tools/weather-tool\";\n\nconst result = await generateText({\n  model: openai(\"gpt-4o\"),\n  tools: { weather: weatherTool },\n  prompt: \"What is the weather in San Francisco?\",\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep examples focused**: Each example should demonstrate one feature or use case\n\n2. **Use descriptive prompts**: Make it clear what the example is testing\n\n3. **Handle errors gracefully**: The `run()` wrapper handles this automatically\n\n4. **Use realistic model IDs**: Use actual model IDs that work with the provider\n\n5. **Add comments for complex logic**: Explain non-obvious code patterns\n\n6. **Reuse tools when appropriate**: Use `weatherTool` or create new reusable tools in `tools/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:34:33.849Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced multi-modal LLM integration and AI SDK function development","zh":"适合像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要高级的多模态 LLM 集成和 AI SDK 函数开发","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しています。これらは、多モーダル LLM の高度な統合と AI SDK 関数の開発が必要です","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 이들은 고급 멀티모달 LLM 통합 및 AI SDK 함수 개발이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una integración avanzada de LLM multi-modal y desarrollo de funciones de SDK de IA","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une intégration avancée de LLM multi-modal et un développement de fonctions de SDK de IA","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine erweiterte multi-modale LLM-Integration und eine KI-SDK-Funktionsentwicklung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de integração avançada de LLM multi-modal e desenvolvimento de funções de SDK de IA","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходима продвинутая интеграция многомодального LLM и разработка функций SDK ИИ","ar":"مثالي لعميلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل متقدم من LLM متعدد الوضعيات وتنمية وظائف SDK للذكاء الاصطناعي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to connect videos in Mux accounts to multi-modal LLMs using a TypeScript library, enabling seamless validation, testing, and iteration on AI SDK functions across providers, including generating text with `generateText()`","zh":"使得代理能够使用 TypeScript 库将 Mux 账户中的视频连接到多模态 LLM，实现对 AI SDK 函数的无缝验证、测试和迭代，包括使用 `generateText()` 生成文本","ja":"TypeScript ライブラリを使用して、Mux アカウント内のビデオを多モーダル LLM に接続できるため、AI SDK 関数のシームレスな検証、テスト、およびイテレーションが可能になります。さらに、`generateText()` を使用してテキストを生成できます","ko":"TypeScript 라이브러리를 사용하여 Mux 계정의 비디오를 멀티모달 LLM에 연결하여 AI SDK 함수의 무결점 검증, 테스트 및 반복을 가능하게 하며, `generateText()`를 사용하여 텍스트를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a conectar videos en cuentas de Mux con LLM multi-modales utilizando una biblioteca de TypeScript, lo que permite una validación, prueba e iteración sin problemas de las funciones de SDK de IA en varios proveedores, incluida la generación de texto con `generateText()`","fr":"Permet aux agents de connecter des vidéos dans des comptes Mux à des LLM multi-modales à l''aide d''une bibliothèque TypeScript, ce qui permet une validation, des tests et une itération sans problème des fonctions de SDK de IA sur plusieurs fournisseurs, notamment la génération de texte avec `generateText()`","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Videos in Mux-Konten mit multi-modalen LLMs mithilfe einer TypeScript-Bibliothek zu verbinden, was eine nahtlose Überprüfung, Testung und Iteration von KI-SDK-Funktionen über mehrere Anbieter hinweg ermöglicht, einschließlich der Textgenerierung mit `generateText()`","pt":"Habilita os agentes a conectar vídeos em contas Mux a LLMs multi-modais usando uma biblioteca TypeScript, permitindo uma validação, teste e iteração sem problemas nas funções do SDK de IA em vários fornecedores, incluindo a geração de texto com `generateText()`","ru":"Позволяет агентам подключать видео в учетных записях Mux к многомодальным LLM с помощью библиотеки TypeScript, обеспечивая беспрепятственную проверку, тестирование и итерацию функций SDK ИИ от различных поставщиков, включая генерацию текста с помощью `generateText()`","ar":"يمكن العميل من连接 مقاطع الفيديو في حسابات Mux مع LLMs متعدد الوضعيات باستخدام مكتبة TypeScript، مما يسمح بالتحقق والاختبار والتكرار السلس لدوال SDK للذكاء الاصطناعي عبر مقدمي الخدمات، بما في ذلك توليد النص باستخدام `generateText()`"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating AI SDK functions across multiple providers","Testing and iterating on text generation with `generateText()`","Integrating videos with multi-modal LLMs for enhanced content analysis"],"zh":["跨多个提供商验证 AI SDK 函数","使用 `generateText()` 测试和迭代文本生成","将视频与多模态 LLM 集成以增强内容分析"],"ja":["複数のプロバイダーをまたいで AI SDK 関数を検証する","`generateText()` を使用してテキスト生成をテストおよびイテレートする","ビデオを多モーダル LLM と統合してコンテンツ分析を強化する"],"ko":["여러 공급자에 걸쳐 AI SDK 함수를 검증하는 것","`generateText()`를 사용하여 텍스트 생성을 테스트 및 반복하는 것","비디오를 멀티모달 LLM과 통합하여 컨텐츠 분석을 강화하는 것"],"es":["Validar funciones de SDK de IA en varios proveedores","Probar e iterar sobre la generación de texto con `generateText()`","Integrar videos con LLM multi-modales para un análisis de contenido mejorado"],"fr":["Valider les fonctions de SDK de IA sur plusieurs fournisseurs","Tester et itérer sur la génération de texte avec `generateText()`","Intégrer des vidéos avec des LLM multi-modales pour une analyse de contenu améliorée"],"de":["KI-SDK-Funktionen über mehrere Anbieter hinweg zu überprüfen","Die Textgenerierung mit `generateText()` zu testen und zu iterieren","Videos mit multi-modalen LLMs für eine verbesserte Inhaltsanalyse zu integrieren"],"pt":["Validar funções do SDK de IA em vários fornecedores","Testar e iterar a geração de texto com `generateText()`","Integrar vídeos com LLMs multi-modais para análise de conteúdo aprimorada"],"ru":["Проверка функций SDK ИИ от различных поставщиков","Тестирование и итерация генерации текста с помощью `generateText()`","Интеграция видео с многомодальными LLM для расширенного анализа контента"],"ar":["التحقق من وظائف SDK للذكاء الاصطناعي عبر مقدمي الخدمات","اختبار وتكرار توليد النص باستخدام `generateText()`","دمج مقاطع الفيديو مع LLMs متعدد الوضعيات لتحليل المحتوى المتقدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Mux account and TypeScript library setup","Limited to AI SDK functions and multi-modal LLMs supported by the library"],"zh":["需要 Mux 账户和 TypeScript 库设置","仅限于库支持的 AI SDK 函数和多模态 LLM"],"ja":["Mux アカウントと TypeScript ライブラリの設定が必要","ライブラリでサポートされている AI SDK 関数と多モーダル LLM だけが使用可能"],"ko":["Mux 계정 및 TypeScript 라이브러리 설정이 필요","라이브러리에서 지원하는 AI SDK 함수 및 멀티모달 LLM만 사용할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Mux y una configuración de la biblioteca de TypeScript","Limitado a las funciones de SDK de IA y a los LLM multi-modales compatibles con la biblioteca"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Mux et une configuration de la bibliothèque TypeScript","Limité aux fonctions de SDK de IA et aux LLM multi-modales pris en charge par la bibliothèque"],"de":["Benötigt ein Mux-Konto und eine TypeScript-Bibliothek-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf KI-SDK-Funktionen und multi-modale LLMs, die von der Bibliothek unterstützt werden"],"pt":["Requer configuração de conta Mux e biblioteca TypeScript","Limitado a funções do SDK de IA e LLMs multi-modais suportados pela biblioteca"],"ru":["Требует настройки учетной записи Mux и библиотеки TypeScript","Ограничен функциями SDK ИИ и многомодальными LLM, поддерживаемыми библиотекой"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد حساب Mux ومكتبة TypeScript","محدود بذوات SDK للذكاء الاصطناعي و LLMs متعدد الوضعيات التي تدعمها المكتبة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a8bbd98d8873d65391d19b295e97f8911d2678d6f716730229c100b366024b26","qualityScore":50}');
