INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ionfury/homelab/sre', 'sre', 'ionfury', 'homelab', 'community', 'sre ionfury homelab community devops harvester k8s-at-home kubernetes rancher rke The sre skill enables AI agents to debug Kubernetes incidents using 5 Whys Analysis and Multi-Source Correlation, benefiting devops teams and Kubernetes administrators. SRE 技术提供了 Kubernetes 故障排除、集群访问和内部服务 URL 的解决方案，帮助开发者提高效率 SRE 技術は、Kubernetes のトラブルシューティング、クラスタアクセス、内部サービス URL の解決策を提供し、開発者の効率を向上させます SRE 기술은 Kubernetes 문제 해결, 클러스터 액세스 및 내부 서비스 URL의 해결책을 제공하여 개발자의 효율성을 향상시킵니다 SRE es una habilidad que permite la configuración y el análisis de incidentes en clústeres Kubernetes SRE est une compétence qui permet la configuration et l''analyse des incidents dans les clusters Kubernetes SRE ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Konfiguration und Analyse von Incidenten in Kubernetes-Clustern ermöglicht O SRE é uma habilidade que fornece acesso a clusters, padrões de KUBECONFIG e URLs de serviços internos, com foco em depuração de incidentes SRE - это навык, который предоставляет доступ к кластерам, шаблонам KUBECONFIG и внутренним URL-адресам служб, с фокусом на устранении несоответствий SRE هو مهارة توفر وصولًا إلى المجموعات، ونماذج KUBECONFIG، و عناوين URL للخدمات الداخلية، مع التركيز على تحليل الحوادث how to use sre for Kubernetes debugging sre vs traditional debugging methods sre setup guide for AI agents what is sre in devops sre alternative for Kubernetes incident management kubernetes debugging best practices with sre SRE Kubernetes 故障排除 集群访问 内部服务 URL KUBECONFIG 5 Whys 分析 devops harvester k8s-at-home rancher rke Applies 5 Whys Analysis for root cause identification Utilizes Read-Only Investigation for observing and analyzing Kubernetes resources Combines logs, events, and metrics for Multi-Source Correlation Integrates with k8s skill for cluster access and KUBECONFIG patterns Supports direct mutations for debugging in dev clusters sre is a skill for debugging Kubernetes incidents, focusing on root cause analysis and multi-source correlation for efficient issue resolution');
